msgid "Enhanced Hearing"
msgstr "聽覺強化"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks"
msgstr "記憶庫強化"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Expanded Digestive System"
msgstr "擴充消化系統"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated AR System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Extremely thin lenses provide user with augmented reality overlay allowing "
"the user to zoom, and it displays handy information about local topology."
msgstr "極細微的鏡片提供使用者可縮放的擴增實境介面，並且能夠提供有用的當地拓撲學資訊。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion"
msgstr "易容裝置"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter"
msgstr "指尖打火機"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser"
msgstr "指尖雷射"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack"
msgstr "手指駭客"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick"
msgstr "手指開鎖器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors"
msgstr "指尖刀刃"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator"
msgstr "閃光產生器"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Protective Lenses"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Frames along your cheekbones and eyesockets can, at a moment's notice, "
"deploy protective lenses which seal your eyes behind polarized ballistic "
"glass, providing protection from glare, bright flashes, physical attacks, "
"and even environmental sources."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Glowy Thing"
msgstr "發出微光的玩意兒"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Heat Drain"
msgstr "熱能吸取"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles"
msgstr "液壓肌肉"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision"
msgstr "植入式夜視儀"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Stun Gun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wired Reflexes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implanted nerve stimulators grant you a +2 bonus to dexterity while this "
"bionic is active, but a -1 penalty when it is not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Improperly installed wires cause a physical stiffness in most of your body, "
"causing increased encumbrance."
msgstr "錯誤地安裝導線使你的身體負擔增加, 導致你的身體僵硬。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Squeaky Ankles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"In a cruel twist of fate, a poorly executed CBM surgery has given you a pair"
" of useless bionics which make squeaking noises when you walk."
msgstr "扭曲的殘酷命運，一個錯誤執行的CBM手術造成了腳踝會在時走路會嘎嘎作響的狀況。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Probability Travel"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr "增加你身體的波長, 讓你能夠以量子穿隧的方式穿過牆壁出現在另一邊。待命時的能量消耗少, 但是每穿梭一格時會耗用 250 點生化能量。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Infolink"
msgstr "腦內無線電"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infrared Vision"
msgstr "紅外線視覺"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Repair Nanobots"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they "
"will flit about your body, repairing damage at 1 HP per minute and stopping "
"bleeding at the cost of extra power and stored calories.  No power is "
"consumed if there is nothing to heal."
msgstr ""
"你的身體有一批休眠中的微型機器人。只要從你的能量儲存器充電後，就會佈滿你的全身，以每分鐘 1HP "
"的速率修復損傷並能以額外的能量與卡路里為代價來止血。如果不需要治療就不會消耗能量。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "Integrated AR System"
msgid_plural "Integrated AR Systems"
msgstr[0] "整合式擴增實境系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Circuitry Toolset"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Multimeter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Multitool"
msgstr "多功能整合工具手"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Chronometer"
msgstr "內部計時器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Climate Control"
msgstr "恆溫控制系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Intravenous Needletip"
msgstr "靜脈注射針"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing"
msgstr "很癢的金屬東西"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Servo"
msgstr "關節伺服馬達"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet"
msgstr "關節發電器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "LED Tattoo"
msgstr "LED 紋身"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cranial Reinforcement"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Largely subdermal, your skull is protected by titanium plates that provide a"
" modicum of protection against all sorts of trauma."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Leaky Bionic"
msgstr "生化洩漏"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Legs Alloy Plating"
msgstr "合金裝甲－腿部"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System"
msgstr "白血球培養系統"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Flashbang Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Light emitting diodes surgically integrated into your skin can release a "
"flash comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers "
"integrated into your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."
msgstr "發光二極管整合在你的皮膚，能夠釋放出媲美閃光彈的效果，讓附近的敵人失明。整合在你身體的揚聲器也能發出極大的聲響，讓敵人失聰。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Subdermal Carbon Filament"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Lying just beneath your skin is a thin armor made of carbon nanotubes.  This"
" has no impact on blunt trauma but will protect you against deep cuts."
msgstr "一層薄薄的碳奈米管製成的裝甲置於你的皮膚之下。 它無法防禦鈍擊傷害，但可以保護你免受過深的斬擊傷害。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Magnetic Repulsor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Metabolic Interchange"
msgstr "代謝交換器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Blade"
msgstr "單分子刀"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator"
msgstr "機電控制過載"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Muscle Augmentation"
msgstr "肌肉增強"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Water Extraction Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Nanotubes surgically embedded in the palm of your hand will pump any "
"available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and convert it "
"into drinkable water.  You must, however, have a container to store the "
"water in."
msgstr "你的手掌植入了奈米碳管讓你能從屍體中提取水分， 並淨化成可飲用的淨水。但是你要先準備個容器裝水。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Nictitating Membrane"
msgstr "瞬膜"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Noisemaker"
msgstr "噪音產生器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Offensive Defense System"
msgstr "攻擊性防禦系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Olfactory Mask"
msgstr "氣味遮罩"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Finger-Mounted Laser"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has a small high-powered laser surgically embedded in "
"it.  This long range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very "
"accurate, and has the potential to start fires."
msgstr "你的一根手指以手術埋入了高功率的雷射。這個長程武器造成的傷害不大, 但非常準確, 並且可能會造成火災。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingerhack"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electrohack surgically embedded in it; an all-"
"purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and the like (but not "
"computers).  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage "
"your circuits."
msgstr ""
"你其中一根手指手術嵌入了電子駭客: 一個全功能的駭客元件， 能夠從控制面板操縱整個系統 (但不適用於電腦)。需要較高的 \"電腦\" 技能， "
"若失敗有可能傷害你的迴路。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingerpick"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electronic lockpick surgically embedded in it.  "
"This automatic system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key "
"locks without any skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr "你的一根手指通過手術植入了電子解鎖工具，它可以幫你快速解開大部分的門鎖而無須技能。但它對更先進的門鎖則是一點辦法都沒有。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Motor Control Overstimulator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One piezoelectric solenoid surgically installed backwards, two crossed "
"wires, and four burned-out capacitors later you started falling on your face"
" and writhing around at the least convenient times.  This incorrectly-"
"configured bionic periodically stuns you for a short duration."
msgstr "一個壓電電磁在手術中被裝反了，兩條線短路了，四顆電容燒掉了，然後你的臉就會轉來轉去。這個配置錯誤的生化插件定期會把你弄暈一下。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Overload"
msgstr "能量超載"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage"
msgstr "能量儲存室"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage Mk. II"
msgstr "能量儲存室 Mk. II"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Thermal Dissipation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are surgically woven into your flesh."
"  While powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees "
"Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect your internal temperature."
msgstr "你的皮膚以手術埋入了強大的超導散熱片。當啟動時，這個系統能夠防止你受到熱傷害，最高可到 2000華氏度。注意這不會影響到你的體溫。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Probability Travel"
msgstr "分解傳輸"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Protective Lenses"
msgstr "防護鏡片"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Biomonitor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System"
msgstr "輻射淨化系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radioactive Leak"
msgstr "輻射洩漏"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Recoil Compensators"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Reactive shock absorbers installed in your wrists and elbows which greatly "
"reduce felt recoil."
msgstr "裝在你手腕和手肘的反應性避震器，大大減少感受到的後座力。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Recoil Compensators"
msgstr "後座力補償器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Recycler Unit"
msgstr "回收消化器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Remote Controller"
msgstr "遠端遙控"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Repair Nanobots"
msgstr "奈米機器人修復器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgstr "自鎖大拇指"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Self-Locking Thumbs"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Self-locking thumbs hold tight (even when you really don't want them to) and"
" don't let go (even when you'd rather they did).  Increases hand encumbrance"
" by ten, while failing to improve your ability to hold objects whatsoever."
msgstr "自鎖大拇指會在你無法控制的狀況下自動卡住不放。增加手掌累贅 10 ， 無法增加你抓東西的能力。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sensory Dulling"
msgstr "知覺阻隔"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shockwave Generator"
msgstr "震波產生器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shotgun Arm"
msgstr "手臂霰彈槍"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sleep Mode"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Analysis"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small sensors have been surgically implanted around your kidneys, allowing "
"you to analyze your blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and "
"other conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sonic Resonator"
msgstr "聲波共振器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sound Dampeners"
msgstr "隔音器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Squeaky Ankles"
msgstr "嘎嘎踝關節"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Subaquatic Navigation System"
msgstr "水下導航系統CBM"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament"
msgstr "碳纖維皮下組織"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electromagnetic Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically embedded in your left arm is a powerful electromagnet, allowing "
"you to use your own strength to pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"you.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""
"你的左手臂通過手術植入了強力的電池鐵，能夠讓你使用自身的力量將所有靠近你的磁性物體全吸向你。倒楣的旁觀者可能會被這些飛行的物件傷害或甚至殺死。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated Multitool"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your hands and forearms is a set of compact tools "
"and a welder that runs off your internal power banks."
msgstr "你的手和前臂植入了一整組密集的工具和使用你生化能量的電焊機。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cranial Flashlight"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically mounted between your eyes is a small but powerful LED flashlight."
msgstr "你的眉心之中安裝了小而強的 LED 燈。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Directional EMP"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically mounted in your left arm and the palm of your left hand are small"
" parabolic EMP field generators.  You may use power to fire a wide but "
"short-ranged blast that will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr "在你的手臂到手掌中植入了小型的EMP (電磁脈衝) 產生器。你能夠使用能量發射短程電磁波來癱瘓電器以及機器人。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator"
msgstr "突觸加速器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System"
msgstr "神經突觸再生系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synthetic Lungs"
msgstr "合成肺臟"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Targeting System"
msgstr "瞄準系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Modifier"
msgstr "味覺調整"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Teleportation Unit"
msgstr "空間傳送"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Terranian Sonar"
msgstr "地形聲納"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Thalamic Buffer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Eyes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The eyes have been entirely replaced by a pair of implanted cameras which "
"provide clear, high-resolution vision and come with a built-in zoom that "
"allows the user to see long distances and treat all ranged weapons as though"
" they had a scope.  If unpowered, the user will be completely blind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Intravenous Needletip"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh of the inside of your middle finger has been replaced with a tube "
"leading into your arteries, with a retractable needle extending out of the "
"tip of the finger when clenched.  This lets you pump intravenous drugs like "
"morphine directly into your bloodstream without needing to carry a syringe."
msgstr ""
"你中指的血肉被替換成通向動脈的管子，末端接著握拳時會從指尖伸出來的針頭。這樣你就可以將嗎啡之類的靜脈注射藥直接注入到血液中，而不需要另外帶一隻針筒。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Finger Lighter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The index finger of your left hand has a fire starter that can extend from "
"the tip."
msgstr "你左手的食指裝有可以從指尖升出來的點火器。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation"
msgstr "散熱裝置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Leaky Bionic"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This botched piece of bionic hardware slowly leaks electrolytic compounds, "
"piezoelectric nanomaterials, and other high-tech contaminants into your "
"bloodstream.  Needless to say, this is not good for your health."
msgstr "這個劣質的生化插件慢慢的流出電解化合物, 壓電納米物質, 以及其他高科技的污染物到你的血液之中。不用多說, 你也知道這樣對健康不好。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Radioactive Leak"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "This damaged CBM occasionally leaks radiation."
msgstr "這個損壞的生化插件偶爾會釋放出輻射。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cloaking System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make you blend into"
" your background, rendering you fully invisible to normal vision.  However, "
"you may be detected by infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr "這個高耗能的系統使用了攝影與顯像技術讓你融入背景, 讓正常視覺的人看不見你。然而你還是會被紅外線, 聲納等技術偵測到。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Teleportation Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting your body up to 25 feet at the cost of much power.  Note that "
"prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."
msgstr "這個實驗性的插件能夠把空間折疊, 消耗大量的能量, 即刻把你的身體傳送到 25 呎遠的地方。需要注意的是長期或頻繁使用可能有危險的副作用。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Aero-Evaporator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles "
"directly into your blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr "這個插件能夠從空氣中聚集水分，並逐漸的輸送到你的血液之中。在非常乾燥的環境下可能會失敗。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Endocrine Enervator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through a combination of psychochemical manipulation and old fashioned "
"electrical nerve stimulation, this malfunctioning bionic alters your brain "
"chemistry in such a way as to cause fatigue.  You will find yourself tiring "
"a bit faster than before."
msgstr "透過心理化合物的操作組合與過時的電子神經刺激, 這個故障的生化插件以某種方式改變了你的大腦化學物質。你發現你自己比以前更容易變得疲勞。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Facial Distortion"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, you are capable "
"of altering your facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of "
"others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr "你的臉能夠透過電子脈衝調整結構, 巧妙地影響他人對你的反應。讓你在社交方面得到好處。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Dielectric Capacitance System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors "
"which can be charged with bionic power to temporarily protect you from "
"external electrical discharge."
msgstr "你整個身體埋入了微型壓電電容, 能夠透過使用生化能量來讓你暫時免於受到外在的觸電傷害。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Internal Climate Control"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of thermal piping, which eases the "
"effects of high and low ambient temperatures when activated."
msgstr "你的全身安裝了生化熱導管， 啟動時能讓你不怎麼受到環境溫度影響。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Throwing Assist"
msgstr "投擲輔助"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Time Dilation"
msgstr "時間膨脹"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Radiation Biomonitor"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Tiny sensors implanted in your body are able to detect acute radiation "
"syndrome through a gamma-H2AX assay, cross-checking blood cell counts to "
"rapidly inform you of the severity of your exposure.  A separate sensor also"
" scans your immediate environment to alert you to the presence of ionizing "
"radiation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Titanium Skeletal Bracing"
msgstr "鈦製骨架支撐"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Titanium Skeletal Bracing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Titanium bracing has been installed onto your elbows, knees, and spine, "
"making them far better at handling strain.  Your carrying capacity is "
"increased by 20 kilograms, or about 44 pounds, and you receive slightly less"
" bashing damage to your arms, legs and torso."
msgstr ""
"鈦合金骨架被植入了你的膝蓋、手肘和脊椎內，讓其能夠更好的承受壓力。 你的負重提升了20公斤，約44磅，同時你的手部、腿部與軀幹受到更少的鈍擊傷害。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Ultrabright Flashlight"
msgstr "超明亮手電筒"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Uncanny Dodge"
msgstr "閃避直覺"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Unified Power System"
msgstr "UPS系統"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Visceral Armorgel"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Visual Disruptor"
msgstr "視覺干擾"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Voice Remodulator"
msgstr "機械變聲器"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Water Extraction Unit"
msgstr "水分萃取元件"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Weather Reader"
msgstr "天氣預報"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Artificial Night Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2 tile radius through"
" destructive interference."
msgstr "啟動時此生化插件會以相消干涉消除 2 格內的所有光線。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Implanted Night Vision"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic will amplify existing light, allowing you to see in"
" the dark."
msgstr "當啟動時，這個生化插件可以放大微弱光線，讓你能夠在黑暗中視物。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sound Dampeners"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "When this bionic is active, you can block hearing completely."
msgstr "當啟動時，這個生化插件可以完全隔絕聲音。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Enhanced Hearing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, "
"allowing you to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage your hearing."
msgstr "當啟動這個生化插件時, 你的聽力會大幅提高, 讓你比一般人的聽力高出 10 倍。另外, 過高分貝的的聲音也將會被自動阻斷以防損壞你的聽力。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Hydraulic Muscles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your "
"strength by 20."
msgstr "當能力啟動時, 你的肌力將獲得增強, 你將因此增加 20 力量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Subaquatic Navigation System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While active, a tiny device in your inner ear periodically generates "
"ultrasonic pulses which aid in navigation, provided you are underwater and "
"able to hear."
msgstr "植入內耳的小型裝置。 開啟時，它會週期性地發出超音波脈衝，協助你導航，前提是你得在水下並且能聽到聲音。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Targeting System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While active, this bionic provides a visual HUD synced to sensors in your "
"hands that greatly aid in targeting ranged weapons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Heat Drain"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and increasing your power reserves slightly."
msgstr "當你徒手與溫血生物戰鬥時, 有機會在成功擊中對手時吸取熱能, 造成少量的額外傷害, 同時稍微增加你的能量儲備。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electroshock Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra "
"damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr "當你徒手戰鬥或是使用能導電的武器時, 將有機會成功電擊你的對手, 造成額外的傷害並短暫的癱瘓對手, 只需要花費一些能量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Olfactory Mask"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, "
"making it nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."
msgstr "當啟動這個系統時, 你的身體氣味會大幅減少, 讓附近的生物不易追查你的蹤跡。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
msgstr "僵化線材"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Wired Reflexes"
msgstr "神經反射增強"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Leukocyte Breeder System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You are equipped with bionic stimulators which augment your haematopoiesis "
"system, allowing you to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic "
"power.  It is supposed to run continuously and may cause unpleasant side "
"effects when turned off."
msgstr ""
"你裝置了能夠刺激白血球生長的造血系統, 讓你能消耗生化能量來加快體內白血球的製造。這個系統需要持續運行, 在關閉時可能會導致不愉快的副作用。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Ultrabright Flashlight"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You can greatly intensify the power of your bionic flashlight to be much "
"brighter at a much higher power cost."
msgstr "能讓你以更高的耗電量，大幅增強你的仿生手電筒的功率。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Glowy Thing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You don't think that capacitor is *meant* to glow, but it does, and usually "
"at bad times.  A malfunctioning bionic randomly turns on and off, causing "
"you to glow and making you visible in the dark without improving how much "
"you can see in the slightest."
msgstr ""
"你不認為那個電容應該要發光，但它確實在發光，而且通常是在不洽當的時候。這個故障的生化插件會自己開開關關，使你發光並能在黑暗中視物，但絲毫沒有改善你的能看多遠。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Shockwave Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You generate a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  "
"Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact "
"with impassable terrain, and knockback any creatures they collide with."
msgstr "你能夠產生強大的震波, 震飛所有靠近你的生物。目標將會被短暫擊昏, 並擊退任何撞上的生物, 若然碰上無法通過的地形還會受到額外傷害。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Unified Power System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a Unified Power System wired into your power banks.  Objects that "
"run on a UPS can now draw directly from your bionic power supply."
msgstr "你體內的能量庫現在裝了一個 UPS， 使用 UPS 作為能量的物品現在可以直接使用你的生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Battery System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a battery draining attachment, and thus can make use of the energy "
"contained in normal, everyday batteries.  Use bionic menu to drain charge "
"from a battery.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr "這是一個電力提取的插件， 能夠用來從一般的電池中提取能量。從生化插件介面來使用電池。可以任意地開關。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cable Charger System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a complex port surgically mounted above your hip.  While active, it"
" will recharge bionic power when connected to a power source via jumper "
"cable."
msgstr "你的臀部上方安裝了一個複雜的端口。啟動後，它會以跨接電纜所連接的電源來補充生化能量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Implanted Stun Gun"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a powerful stun gun built into your hand.  Activate to attempt to "
"zap an adjacent enemy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Internal Chronometer"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been equipped with an internal atomic clock, ensuring that you will"
" always know the current time.  Additionally, it includes a silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr "你的體內裝了一個原子鐘讓你隨時都知道現在的時間, 除此之外, 它還附加了一個靜音鬧鐘的功能。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Expanded Digestive System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been outfitted with three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only can you extract much more nutrition from food, but you"
" are highly resistant to foodborne illness, and can sometimes eat rotten "
"food."
msgstr "你的消化器官已被改造成合成胃以及工業級腸子。不僅能夠從食物提取更多營養, 並且還能抵抗食源性疾病, 另外有時候也能吃腐敗的食物。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synthetic Lungs"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have highly efficient artificial lungs which greatly increase your "
"oxygen intake.  If they are not powered you will suffocate, and they weaken "
"your immune system somewhat."
msgstr "高效率的人工肺，可以大大增加氧氣攝入量。 如果它們失去供能，你就會窒息，而且它們會在某種程度上削弱你的免疫系統。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingertip Razors"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You possess razor-sharp claws underneath your nails which can be deployed by"
" flexing your fingers.  While active, they can be used in combat as long as "
"you are unarmed and your fingers are not covered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Voice Remodulator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You will likely spend the rest of your days serving as a walking testament "
"to why you don't opt for the Autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package'.  A "
"remodulator unit jammed down your throat has given you a creepy robot voice."
msgstr "接下來的日子你每天都會想著，為什麼當初調整好自動醫生的「生化人身分包」。一個重調變器卡在你的喉嚨結果讓你說話變成詭異的機械人聲。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Nostril"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You're really not sure how the CBM ended up in your nose, but no matter how "
"it got there this badly misplaced bionic makes it difficult to breathe.  "
"Increases mouth encumbrance by ten."
msgstr "你真的不知道為什麼最後這個生化插件會跑去你的鼻子， 不管怎樣， 這個東西讓你很不好呼吸。增加嘴巴累贅 10 點。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Visceral Armorgel"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your abdominal and thoracic cavities are internally padded with thin pockets"
" of a biocompatible gel that hardens on impact to protect your spine and "
"organs.  While this doesn't prevent superficial injury, it should make you a"
" bit tougher overall, at least as far as your torso is concerned."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Chain Lightning"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your body is equipped with a chain lightning generator, allowing you to emit"
" a blast of lightning at a target, leaving a trail of lightning in its wake,"
" jumping to additional targets within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr "你的身體安裝了連鎖閃電產生器, 讓你能夠先攻擊一個目標, 然後還能傳導傷害到目標 4 格內的其他目標。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cerebral Booster"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has been enhanced with bionic coprocessors, giving you a +2 bonus"
" to intelligence when this implant is active, and a -1 penalty when it is "
"not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Metabolic Interchange"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system and power supply are interconnected; bionic energy is "
"replenished by burning calories.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr "你的消化系統與能量供應系統連結。你可以透過燃燒卡路里來補充生化能量。能夠任意地開關。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sonic Resonator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your entire body may resonate at very high power, creating a short-range "
"shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to creatures, solid objects "
"such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr "你的身體能產生高能共振，發出短距的衝擊波。衝擊波對生物影響不大，但對堅固的物體如牆壁和門都將造成損壞。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Nictitating Membrane"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes are equipped with thin membranes that cover your eyes while "
"underwater, negating any vision penalties."
msgstr "你的眼睛上覆蓋著一側透明的人工薄膜，讓你在水下仍能清晰視物，不受視野懲罰。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Terranian Sonar"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your feet are equipped with precision sonar equipment, allowing you to "
"detect the movements of creatures below the ground, buried traps, and "
"unstable terrain."
msgstr "你的腳掌安裝了精準的聲納感知裝置，讓你能夠偵測地下生物的動靜、埋藏的陷阱或不穩定的地形。。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated Circuitry Toolset"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers and arms have been implanted a soldering iron, a multimeter, "
"and a set of small screwdrivers, providing all the tools required for "
"working with bench-scale electrical circuits.  This also provides your hands"
" and arms with a modicum of protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated Multimeter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers and arms have been implanted with retractable electrical probes"
" connected to a multimeter embedded in your arm, allowing you to measure "
"electrical voltage, resistance, and current by touch.  This also provides "
"your hands and arms with a modicum of protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Joint Torsion Ratchet"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your joints have been surgically equipped with torsion ratchets that slowly "
"generate power when you move.  Whilst this is toggled, moving will require "
"more effort, though more power will be generated."
msgstr "你的關節以手術裝配了轉輪發電器, 能夠在你移動的時候緩慢產生能量。儘管這個功能可以切換，但在使用之時需要更多的體力，才能夠產生更多的能量。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Joint Servo"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your leg joints have been equipped with servomotors that provide power-"
"assisted movement.  Movement takes less effort when this bionic is online.  "
"However, when it's offline it will hamper your movement, as you struggle "
"against its moving parts."
msgstr "您的腿關節配備了伺服馬達，提供動力輔助移動。當啟動時，移動更加輕易。但是，當關閉時反而會妨礙你的移動因為你還要帶動沒在運作的部件。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Enhanced Memory Banks"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your memory has been enhanced with small quantum storage drives.  While "
"active, you learn - both through reading and practice - more quickly.  "
"Additionally, you forget skills you've learned slower."
msgstr "你的記憶力被小型量子儲存器強化，當啟動時，你透過閱讀以及練習的學習速度會變得更快。此外，你遺忘技能的速度減慢。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Muscle Augmentation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your muscules have been surgically enhanced with synthetic myomer fibers, "
"giving you a +2 bonus to strength when this implant is active and a -1 "
"penalty when it is not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Uncanny Dodge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been augmented with bionic processors, allowing you "
"to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr "你的神經系統已經由生化處理器加強, 讓你能夠比一般人更加容易閃避攻擊。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synaptic Accelerator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been enhanced with bionic stimulators, giving you a "
"10% boost to your speed."
msgstr "你的神經系統透過生化刺激裝置增強, 讓你獲得額外 10% 的速度。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Close Quarters Battle"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is wired to a combat controller program pre-loaded with "
"its own melee protocols.  While active, your actions in melee combat will be"
" guided by the implant, which has above-average skill and its own martial "
"art style, but you will not learn from this experience."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sensory Dulling"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is wired to allow you to inhibit the signals of pain, "
"allowing you to dull your senses at will.  However, the use of this system "
"may cause delayed reaction time and drowsiness."
msgstr "你的神經系統能夠依照你的意志忽略疼痛, 關閉感官。然而, 使用這個系統有可能會讓你對環境危險慢半拍。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Infrared Vision"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your range of vision extends into the infrared, allowing you to see warm-"
"blooded creatures in the dark or through smoke."
msgstr "你的視力能夠看到紅外線， 讓你能夠在黑暗或煙霧中看到溫血生物。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Recycler Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your urinary tract is fitted with filters and reservoirs that allow your "
"body to reclaim water from metabolic waste while this device is powered, "
"greatly reducing your need to hydrate."
msgstr ""

