#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A fond memory of throating some prey animal bubbles up."
msgstr "一個割斷某些獵物的美好記憶冒了出來。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A terrifyingly real dream has you killing game with your bare teeth."
msgstr "你做了一個你用牙齒進行殺戮的嚇人夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"A warm, sunny spot high up where you can watch your prey.  What a great "
"dream!"
msgstr "一個溫暖高高掛的太陽讓你能夠觀察你的獵物。真是好棒的夢!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After an exciting and tasty hunt, you retire to your nest.  Mmm, yes, nest."
msgstr "經過了刺激與美味的狩獵, 你回到了你的巢。嗯, 沒錯, 巢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After recruiting a new packmate, you expand your spacious den to accommodate"
" them."
msgstr "你夢見自己招募到了一個新夥伴，你擴展了自己寬敞的巢穴來容納他們。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Ah, the wolf-slaying dream again.  That's a good one…"
msgstr "喔， 又夢到把野狼殺光光了， 真不錯。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "An unstoppable hunger like a black hole devours you from within."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "As you dream, your reflection looks rather catlike."
msgstr "在夢裡, 你不自覺地走起了貓步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Boing!  and you've pounced another yummy critter."
msgstr "嘣! 你現在撲到另外一隻可口的小動物身上了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "FIGHT.  FEED.  FORWARD."
msgstr "戰鬥。進食。前進。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Fire rages around you, licking at your bark and engulfing the saplings and "
"bushes near your roots.  The once chatty forest is quiet in its wake."
msgstr "你夢見火焰在你四周肆虐，舔舐你的樹皮，吞沒你根旁的幼苗和灌木。曾經喋喋不休的森林也不再低語。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems "
"to help…"
msgstr "不知為何你夢見你的鞋子。變得不合腳， 而且你不知道怎麼辦…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Hoof.  Talon.  Tooth.  Fight.  Feed.  Forward."
msgstr "蹄。爪。牙。戰鬥。進食。前進。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like image of yourself."
msgstr "在夢中你瞥見自己的牛模樣的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously birdlike reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在夢裡, 你看到了你好奇的鳥兒倒影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In the dream, you fatten yourself up with all the food you can find to "
"prepare for your next winter hibernation."
msgstr "在夢中，你用你能找到的所有食物把自己養胖，為下個冬眠做準備。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a group of rats that look almost like yourself."
msgstr "在你的夢中你看到一群長得像自己的老鼠。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a very spiderlike version of yourself."
msgstr "你在夢中看到蜘蛛版本的自己。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see an odd, slimy reflection of yourself."
msgstr "你在夢中看見自己黏糊糊的奇怪身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream, you see a strangely fishlike image of yourself."
msgstr "在夢中, 你看到了你的樣子是像魚一樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stalk and kill a young wolf, using only your teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr "在你的夢中, 你追蹤並獵殺了一頭幼狼, 只用了你身上的牙與爪。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams, you blindly run through the pipes of the city, navigating "
"the familiar byways via smell alone."
msgstr "在睡夢中，你閉著眼都能在城市的街道中穿行，光靠氣味就能在熟悉的小徑上辨識方向。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams, your fangs slip through flesh like scalpels.  You quickly "
"crawl away to let your clumsy prey bleed out."
msgstr "在你的夢裡，你的尖牙像手術刀一樣刺穿肉體。 你迅速地爬開，讓你笨拙的獵物流血而死。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your sleep you feel verdant energy growing within you."
msgstr "你在睡覺時感到蔥鬱的能量在你體內增長。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Mmm.  The shellfish dream again.  Yum!"
msgstr "又夢到吃了一堆貝類, 真可口!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "NO!  You will not allow this corruption to prevail!"
msgstr "不! 你絕對不允許這腐敗佔上風!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with "
"broad-minded guidance."
msgstr "非馬庫斯有時候會拒絕馬洛斯。我們殖民的努力總算因心胸寬大的指導而開花結果。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh boy!  This hidey hole sure is swell."
msgstr "哦天哪！這個藏身洞可真大。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "On land and in the water, you control all that your tongue can reach."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Once we finish the burrow we'll settle down and start a little family.  "
"Maybe just a dozen boys and a dozen girls.  Nice and cosy."
msgstr "一旦我們挖完洞，我們就能安頓下來，建立一個小小的家庭。也許只要十幾個男孩和十幾個女孩。舒舒服服。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Our colonists are limitless.  We shall adapt to this world, as we adapt to "
"all."
msgstr "我們有成千上萬的殖民者, 我們可以適應這個世界, 就像我們適應其他的東西一樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow add together, don't they?"
msgstr "紅色, 藍色和黃色會互相混合, 不是嗎?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow cancel each other out, don't they?"
msgstr "紅色, 藍色和黃色會互相抵銷, 不是嗎?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Regret haunts your dreams, for your past wrongs real or imagined."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Sneaky sneak under the floorboards.  We will sneak all their crumbs for us."
"  But later, back to sleep for now."
msgstr "偷偷溜到地板下面。我們會偷偷把他們的麵包屑都偷走。但稍後再說，現在得先回去睡覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Something chases you through a maze of unfamiliar tunnels.  At last, it has "
"you cornered, so you turn around and show it your teeth…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The herd moves along and you with them, finding greener pastures."
msgstr "你飼養的牲畜跟著你四處移動, 找尋水草更豐富的牧場。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The seething masses attempt to wall non-Mycus away from the Marloss.  We "
"will adapt and defeat them."
msgstr "極度憤怒的群眾嘗試將非馬庫斯與馬洛斯隔離。我們會適應並且擊敗他們。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The thought of being out of water, forced to crawl unsupported, terrifies "
"you."
msgstr "一想到你掉進水裡, 沒有任何東西給你抓, 你就感到一陣恐懼。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The transition from your lifelike dreams of living as a plant to reality "
"shocks you."
msgstr "你因為夢境中自己變成植物的真實性而嚇到。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The walking plants seek to harness us as a food source.  We will not allow "
"that."
msgstr "這種會行走的植物看起來無害, 而且是一種好的食物來源, 但我不允許這種植物存在。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The world can be whole again, and only you have the courage to make it so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The years seem to fly past as you dream of carving great underground "
"fastnesses."
msgstr "你夢到你在挖掘著巨大的地下要塞, 時間飛快的經過。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Tinnitus follows you into your dreams, where it becomes a chorus of "
"crickets."
msgstr "耳鳴會跟著你進入夢境，變成蟋蟀們的合唱。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We have been waiting a long time for a place such as this."
msgstr "我們尋找這樣子的地點已經很久了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We will raise bountiful orchards and beautiful gardens."
msgstr "我們會種出漂亮的花園和一大堆的蘭花。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr "你因為在夢境中溺水而慌亂的醒來了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid "
"reflection."
msgstr "在做夢的時候你在鏡子中看見自己嚇人的昆蟲模樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr "你做夢的時候, 看到自己的樣子就像是一隻章魚。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "你做夢的時候看到自己的倒影像是蜥蜴一樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively rabbit-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在夢裡，你看到自己有著跟兔子般與眾不同的反應能力。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving "
"treatment."
msgstr "在夢中, 你看到自己穿著病服, 在醫院接受治療。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself in a pond, your face has widened and is "
"covered in mucus."
msgstr "在夢中，你能在池塘里看見自己的倒影，你的臉變寬了，渾身都是粘液。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself weighted down under massive backpack/tent "
"upon your back, as you pass by a mirrored surface."
msgstr "在夢中，當你經過鏡面時，你都能看到自己被背上的巨型背包帳篷壓下。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr "在夢中, 你看到了野獸模樣的自己感到很不安。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Will your burrow be warm enough for the family in winter?"
msgstr "你家的地洞在冬天夠暖和嗎?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are acutely aware that most of you is sleeping, leaving you to "
"contemplate your situation as you rest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are confused by a plantlike image of yourself in a dream."
msgstr "你對你在夢境中看到自己變成植物的模樣感到困惑。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are disturbed when your birdlike dreams are more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你做了一個比你真實生活更逼真的夢境, 是有關於鳥類生活的。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are frightened of the outside after your vivid dream of cave life."
msgstr "你發現你在做完穴居生活的夢境後變得害怕外出。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are many animals, and yet one."
msgstr "你是許多動物中的其中之一。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are perfect, and in your dreams, a million others just like you kneel "
"before your superiority."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming a lizard hybrid."
msgstr "你做了一個自己變成半蜥蜴人的可怕夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of serving the hive queen mindlessly."
msgstr "你被夢境中的自己盲目服從女王蜂而嚇到了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You blissfully recall days spent lounging in the sun."
msgstr "你開心的回想起過去在陽光下閒晃的日子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You can't quite work out what the dream is about… it just keeps changing."
msgstr "你無法確切明白這是個關於什麼的夢… 它只是… 一直在變化。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You creep along, your flexile body transforming shape and color to remain "
"hidden."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You crush those who would disagree with your leadership."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You curl up some more in your nest.  Geez, shredded paper really *is* comfy."
msgstr "你在窩裡又蜷縮了一些。天哪, 碎紙堆真的有夠舒適。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the moon."
msgstr "你夢到月亮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the zoo, for some reason."
msgstr "你不知道為什麼夢到了動物園。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in smells more vivid than sight ever was."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in sounds and smells, not images."
msgstr "你夢見聲音和氣味，而不是影像。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a cold winter night.  Your jacket is too big to put on."
msgstr "你夢見了一個寒冷的冬夜。你的夾克過於巨大以至於無法穿上它。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a feast and excitedly chitter with your pincers… wait, what?"
msgstr "你面見了一場盛宴，並興奮地用你的螯喀嚓喀嚓地……等等，蛤？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a fortress, sheltering humanity from the zombies.  You're in "
"charge, of course."
msgstr "你夢見一座保護人類免受殭屍侵害的堡壘。你是領導，毫不意外。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a home in the forests."
msgstr "你夢見了一個在森林的家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a hospital where doctors try out experimental treatments."
msgstr "你夢見在一間醫院中，醫生們在嘗試實驗性的療法。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a massive block of cheese bigger than you."
msgstr "你夢見一塊比你還大的巨大起司。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a mate, and a dance, and a mother devoured by her own young."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange quest for a bush that grows gray apples."
msgstr "你妄想著能種出可以長出灰色蘋果的灌木。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a vast dark ocean.  The thought of returning to it "
"seems…undesirable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a world one hundred million years gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of an endless spiral you can't help but follow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being a primitive cave dweller."
msgstr "你夢到你變成原始的穴居動物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being cozy in a dark place."
msgstr "你夢見黑暗的地方讓你感到舒適。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of being in two places at once, and four, and yet you are all a "
"greater whole."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being swaddled safe in the embrace of the soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of blood and guts.  For some reason, it makes you feel weirdly "
"excited."
msgstr "你夢見了鮮血與臟器。基於某些原因，這讓你感到異常興奮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of brushing the fur on your back against a tree."
msgstr "你夢見你正對著樹磨蹭你背上的毛皮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of chasing a beautiful butterfly."
msgstr "你夢見追逐一隻美麗的蝴蝶。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of communing with an ancient pine.  Trees are the true survivors "
"of this world, it tells you."
msgstr "你夢到你在與古老的松樹溝通。它說：樹木們才是這個世界真正的倖存者。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of cracking seeds with your beak and swallowing them dry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of crawling along the world when you realize you can see three "
"hundred and sixty degrees around yourself."
msgstr "你夢見自己環繞世界爬行，突然意識到自己能看到周遭360度。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of crushing zombies with your pincer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of curling up inside a shell to sleep."
msgstr "你夢見自己蜷縮在殼裡睡覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of cutting yourself with a knife and watch in fascination as it "
"heals in seconds."
msgstr "你夢見用刀自殘，並著迷地看著傷口在幾秒內癒合。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of death, always at your heels, and your flesh changing to escape "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of defending the herd from a pack of predators."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of digging a hole under a hill to make your home."
msgstr "你夢到你在山丘下挖了個洞當作自己的家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of finally finding the perfect place to make your den."
msgstr "你夢到你終於找到一個完美的地點來建造巢穴。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of flying."
msgstr "你夢見你在飛行。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of foraging in the woods… mouth-first?"
msgstr "你夢見自己在森林裡覓食… 用嘴巴？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of friends and family crowded around, chattering noisily, grooming"
" one another, and sharing blood."
msgstr "你夢見朋友和家人擠在一起，嘰嘰喳喳，互相梳理毛髮，分享鮮血。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grabbing something in an oversized claw."
msgstr "你夢到用超大的爪子抓住東西。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grazing in an open field."
msgstr "你做了一個在廣闊牧場放牛的夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of having that success you knew you deserved, back before all "
"this."
msgstr "你夢到在這一切事情發生前你是多麼的成功。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of jumping the gate and leading your herd to freedom."
msgstr "你夢到你跳上了大門, 並且帶領你飼養的牲畜奔向自由。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of laying eggs in the soft soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of leaping from the water to catch your prey."
msgstr "你夢見自己從水中跳出來捕捉獵物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living as a terrifying octopus mutant."
msgstr "你夢到你生活像是個嚇人的章魚突變體。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living deep inside a dark cave."
msgstr "你做了一個在黑暗洞窟中生活的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living on the ocean floor."
msgstr "你夢到你生活在海底。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of outrunning the apocalypse."
msgstr "你夢見自己跑得比世界末日還快。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of pursuing and killing a rat, for some reason."
msgstr "你夢到正因為某些因素在追逐獵殺一支老鼠。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of ravens calling as you pad away from the remains of a kill."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of recruiting a cult of fishfolk to serve your needs."
msgstr "你夢到你招聘了一群漁民來滿足你對海鮮的渴望。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of rotten food, decomposed until it's almost mush."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of running down familiar streets and rooftops, mentally mapping "
"out every escape route as you go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of sharing your roots with a vast forest, all plants provided for "
"as the canopy grows ever upwards."
msgstr "你夢見自己與一片廣袤的森林共同分享根部，當樹冠不斷向上生長時，所有的植物都得到了滿足。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of sneaking into someone's home to listen to them sleep."
msgstr "你夢見偷偷溜進別人家聽他們睡覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of something biting you but being stopped by your hard outer "
"shell."
msgstr "你夢見有什麼東西咬你，但被你堅硬的外殼阻止了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of something flashing in the distant dark, and you understand "
"every word."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of stalking some sort of lizard… no, that can't be right, can it?"
msgstr "你夢見自己正在跟蹤某種蜥蜴… 不， 那不可能是真的， 對吧？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of standing still in the rain, drinking in the falling drops… with"
" your feet?"
msgstr "你夢見自己佇立雨中，用腳......啜飲著灑落的雨滴？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of still waters, rain, and a chorus of voices raised in song."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of swimming in the open ocean"
msgstr "你夢到了你在大海中游泳。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh kill."
msgstr "你夢到正在撕裂剛獵殺的獵物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into your prey, and the sweet taste of raw flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of the buzzing of a fly that you cannot see.  It makes you hungry."
msgstr "你夢見一隻看不見的蒼蠅在身邊嗡嗡叫著。牠令你感到飢餓。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the changeling.  Again."
msgstr "你再次夢到調換兒。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the crack of bone and the taste of raw meat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt to end all hunts."
msgstr "你夢到一場狩獵，終結所有狩獵的狩獵。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt, the feed, and your pack."
msgstr "你夢到了關於狩獵、吃東西, 還有你的背包。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the moon and feel a sudden urge to howl."
msgstr "你夢見了月亮並突然有一種想要嚎叫的衝動。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the sun shining down on your leaves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the tropics."
msgstr "你夢到熱帶雨林。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of walking along the sea floor."
msgstr "你夢見自己在海床上漫步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of warm breath and fresh blood."
msgstr "你夢見溫暖的呼吸和新鮮的血液。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of washing your hands and face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your legions of undead admirers, their attentions, and the "
"wonderful pain."
msgstr "你幻想著你擁有一隻不死軍團, 享受著他們的膜拜, 還有可能對這世界造成的痛苦, 多美好。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your wings carrying you through the night sky, and the "
"comforting presence of moon and stars above."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of… sneaking."
msgstr "你夢到你在...潛行。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you are lithe in the sunlight and radiant with grace."
msgstr "你夢到你靈巧的在陽光下漫步，渾身散發著優雅的光芒。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream you crawl out from under a rock.  And then immediately crawl back "
"in."
msgstr "你夢到你從岩石下爬出來。然後立刻又爬了回去。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you're safely at home with a bustling family."
msgstr "你夢見你和一群熱鬧的家人們安全地待在家裡。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You easily bound from the street to a roof…oh, only a dream."
msgstr "您輕鬆地一躍就從街上跳到了屋頂上… 哦, 只是個夢而已。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You excitedly web up an interloper and prepare to feast… nope, dream."
msgstr "你興奮地網住了一個闖入者，準備享用盛宴……可惜，有夢最美。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel a yearning…"
msgstr "你內心有種渴望感…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel beautiful, and yet riven with worry…"
msgstr "你覺得很美麗， 但是又擔心四分五裂…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel like you're cracking a combination lock."
msgstr "你覺得你好像正在破解一個密碼鎖。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel nothing but disgust as you dream of strangling your old self."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel warm."
msgstr "你感到暖和。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel… OK."
msgstr "你感覺...OK。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You find it hard to control your limbs after dreaming of amorphous blob "
"life."
msgstr "在做完有關於不定形球狀生命體的夢之後, 你發現你難以控制你的肢體。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find it hard to wake from a vivid dream of grazing on a farm."
msgstr "你做了一個在牧場放牧的生動夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You flutter through the air, listening for echoes to guide you through your "
"dream."
msgstr "你在空中飛翔，傾聽迴音指引你進入夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting and warm dream of living as a rabbit."
msgstr "你做了一個舒適而溫暖的夢，夢見自己像兔子一樣生活。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你作了一個令人舒適的夢, 夢中你和一群魚在水中遨遊。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing and scary dream of becoming a plant."
msgstr "你因為做了一個變成植物的嚇人夢境而感到困惑。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing dream of growing in a garden."
msgstr "你做了一個在花圃中生長的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream about running from dogs."
msgstr "你做了個被一群狗追逐的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of bathing in the sun on a rock."
msgstr "你做了一個有關沐浴在陽光下的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of eating insects."
msgstr "你做了一個令人不安的夢，你在夢裡吃下了昆蟲。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of living in a supermarket lobster tank."
msgstr "你做了一個令人不安的夢，夢裡你是生活在超市的龍蝦魚缸裡。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of someone invading your territory."
msgstr "你做了一個有別人侵犯你的領地, 令人不愉快的夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你作了一個令人不安的夢, 夢中你和一群魚在水中遨遊。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of undergoing strange medical procedures."
msgstr "你做了一個關於進行地下手術的不安夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a lizard."
msgstr "你做了一個生活像是蜥蜴的嚇人夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream of doctors and nurses doing unnatural things to your body, "
"which brings you perverse pleasure."
msgstr "你夢到有醫生和護士對你的身體做不自然的事情, 讓你有種變態的快感。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a dream of working in a hive."
msgstr "你做了一個在蜂巢工作的夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a horrible nightmare of being caught out in the sunlight."
msgstr "你夢到你被抓到太陽底下, 真是一個可怕的惡夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare of being all alone, but then your family flies home to "
"comfort you."
msgstr "你做了一個惡夢，自己孤單一人，但隨後你的家人們飛回家安慰你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a puckish dream."
msgstr "你做了個惡作劇的夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a realistic dream of flying south with your flock for the winter."
msgstr "你做了一個變成侯鳥避寒遷徙的真實夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about animals."
msgstr "你做了一個有關動物的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about bears."
msgstr "你做了一個關於熊的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about being a patient in a frightening hospital."
msgstr "你做了一個在恐怖病院當病患的詭異夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about being the Easter Bunny."
msgstr "你做了一個奇怪的夢，夢見自己是隻復活節兔子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about birds."
msgstr "你做了一個有關於鳥類的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cats."
msgstr "你做了一個關於貓的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cattle."
msgstr "你做了一個有關牛的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about crabs."
msgstr "你做了一個關於螃蟹的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about fish."
msgstr "你做了一個有關於魚類的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about frogs in a pond near your childhood home."
msgstr "你做了奇怪的夢，夢見了你童年時的家附近池塘裡的青蛙。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about insects."
msgstr "你做了一個有關昆蟲的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about living in a cave."
msgstr "你做了一個有關穴居生活的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about lizards."
msgstr "你做了一個有關於蜥蜴的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about plants."
msgstr "你做了一個有關植物的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rabbits."
msgstr "你做了一個有關兔子的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rats."
msgstr "你做了一個有關老鼠的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about sea creatures."
msgstr "你做了一個有關海中生物的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about slime."
msgstr "你做了一個有關黏液的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about snails and slugs in your garden."
msgstr "你做了一個關於在你的花園裡有蝸牛和蛞蝓的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about spiders."
msgstr "你做了一個有關蜘蛛的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about wolves."
msgstr "你做了一個關於狼的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of carrying a house on your back."
msgstr "你做了一個背著房子的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of living in sludge."
msgstr "你做了一個在污泥中生活的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of spinning webs."
msgstr "你夢到你在織網。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "你做了一個怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs "
"with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr "你做了一個關於醫療的生動夢境, 你的心跳和點滴穩定的同步跳動。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "你做了一個有關於在樹林中打獵的生動夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of shedding your carapace.  It feels good."
msgstr "你做了一個生動的夢，脫下你的甲殼。感覺很好。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have an upsetting dream about falling and being unable to get back up."
msgstr "你做了一個令人不安的夢，夢見自己正在墜落，再也爬不起來了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "你做了一個在天空飛翔的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall."
"  Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr "你再次聽到了警報聲, 但這次你留在牆上的洞裡。沒有人會想到那裡看一眼!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You howl loud and long, ecstatic after securing a whole cache of supplies."
msgstr "你夢見自己找到了一大批物資，因而狂喜地大聲嚎叫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You leap from rooftop to rooftop, effortlessly avoiding your pursuers while "
"making your way to safety."
msgstr "你夢見自己從一個屋頂跳到另一個屋頂，毫不費力地避開追擊者，同時逃向安全的地方，my back警告。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You lie in a pile with your brothers and sisters.  Someone keeps moving "
"around, nearly waking you up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr "你感到害怕, 並且大口喘息… 當你幻想著真菌摧毀了你的家!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You relax in your web; it's not vibrating, so dinner hasn't arrived yet."
msgstr "你夢見在自己的網裡放鬆，網沒有震動，所以晚餐還沒到，還沒......"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "你做夢時發出害怕的尖叫因為你夢到被貓追。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "你看到自己的反射像是森林之美。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "你看到五年後的自己, 成為了一個城市的成功領導。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sit at the bottom of the sea, staring without thought at all the world "
"passing by overhead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sneak into a house, only to discover a full, intact cupboard of cat "
"food!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You startle as the shadow of a bird passes over your web, but it's only a "
"dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr "你發現那隻漂亮的小魚原來只存在夢中, 你感到難過。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You swim with fish.  You fly with birds.  You run with the beasts of the "
"land.  You change with the changing of seasons.  You are everything."
msgstr "你和魚一同游在水中。和鳥一同飛在空中。和各種野獸一起奔跑在大地上。季節和你一同變化。你就是萬物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste iron all night long, like you've bitten your tongue."
msgstr "你夢見整晚都嚐到鐵鏽味，就像咬了舌頭一樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste the blood of another, and know that it will be yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "你做了一個被屠夫牽去屠宰場的惡夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr "你做了一個生活在蛛網上捕食昆蟲的生動夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "你做了一個在下水道生活的詭異夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr "你做了帶著背包奔跑, 狩獵動物的生動夢境。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "你清楚的夢到你和你的背包一起大開殺戒。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wake up with your legs pumping as you hop along in your sleep."
msgstr "你在夢中蹦蹦跳跳，醒來時雙腿還不停地抽搐。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas "
"station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream…"
msgstr "你在殭屍的雙腿間穿梭著， 你的身型太小以致於它們無法捕捉到你。加油站現在已經不遠了， 所有的蘇打水和薯片以及 - 呃， 一場夢…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You were once many cells living as one, now you are one living as many."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle…"
msgstr "你希望別人能理解你對森林的愛，並和你一起奮鬥……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were "
"just a legend…"
msgstr "你在想你是否能見到所謂的 \"鮭魚洄游\"， 還是說那只是一個傳說而已…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "你在想你現在的住所是不是已經夠好了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "你從未感受過如此輕盈又充滿力量。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected… oh, just a dream."
msgstr "你的身體比你預期的移動還快… 喔， 原來只是一場夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr "你做了一個有關於植物授粉的怪夢。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "你夢到被動物圍繞, 而且牠們似乎都很喜歡你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr "夢境中的自己終年生活在黑暗中就像是真的一樣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your… muzzle in "
"anticipation."
msgstr "你夢到正在襲擊巨大的蜂巢， 用你的… 口器。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-reflection is rather bearish."
msgstr "在夢裡, 你用熊的方式思考。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self looks competent and in control."
msgstr "你夢到自己很有自信且能幹。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self's muzzle looks… wait, muzzle?"
msgstr "你夢見自己帶著嘴套… 等等， 嘴套？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams are simple.  Movement among the leaves, your heart pounding as "
"you leap through the air, satisfaction when your claws find purchase."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams contain a croaking concerto."
msgstr "你的夢境裡有著嘎嘎作響的協奏曲"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a rough furry feeling."
msgstr "你的夢境帶給你一種粗糙毛皮般的感覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a sleek furry feeling."
msgstr "你的夢境帶給你一種柔順毛皮般的感覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange chitinous feeling."
msgstr "你的夢境帶給你一種甲殼般的奇怪感覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange content, furry feeling."
msgstr "你做了奇怪的夢, 帶給你一種毛皮般的感覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange feathered feeling."
msgstr "你的夢境帶給你一種羽毛般的奇怪感覺。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange furry feeling."
msgstr "你的夢境帶給你一種毛皮般的奇怪感覺。"

