"recover."
msgstr "你喘不過氣。在你恢復前右腿廢了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nodding Out"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're so high that it's difficult to keep your eyes open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bile Splashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're splattered with a greasy layer of liquified putrescence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're staggered off-balance."
msgstr "你被攻擊得失去平衡了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sludged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're standing in sludge!"
msgstr "你踩到了淤泥！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Alcohol Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're starting to feel sick.  You know a drink would fix this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stuck in a Pit"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're stuck in a pit.  Sight distance is limited and you have to climb out."
msgstr "你被卡在一個坑裡了。你的視線距離受限, 你必須爬出來。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stunned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're stunned!"
msgstr "你被震暈了!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Medical Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're tearing yourself apart.  Need to get fixed back up.  Should put some "
"stitches in you."
msgstr "你正在撕裂自己。需要被治療。應該再給你縫個幾針。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stoned, Baked, Blazed, Zooted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're too stoned to keep up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Common Cold"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Influenza"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're too stuffed up to fight effectively."
msgstr "你吃太飽了讓你很難戰鬥。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dazed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're visibly shaken up, and are having a hard time focusing on what's "
"going on around you."
msgstr "你很明顯地被搞得心神不寧, 很難專心注意正發生在自己身旁的事物。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're winded."
msgstr "你覺得喘不過氣。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're zapped!"
msgstr "你被電擊了!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bad High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to fungal acid fumes!"
msgstr "你受到了真菌酸霧的效果影響！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Tear Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to tear gas!"
msgstr "你現在暴露在催淚瓦斯下。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Really Bad High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to thick fungal acid fumes!"
msgstr "你已受到濃厚的真菌酸霧影響！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can no longer keep pushing.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，完全筋疲力竭不能做事了。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can't take much more activity.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，已經不太能繼續工作。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and need to slow down.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 5x, Active: 4x, Brisk: 3x, Moderate: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，最好慢下來。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：5x，積極：4x，活躍： 3x，中度：2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and really need to get some rest.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，且真的需要一些休息。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while; it's time to stop.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，該是時候停下來了。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been knocked off-balance by an attack."
msgstr "你被一次攻擊弄得失去了平衡。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightly Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been pretty active for a while; operating at the highest levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.25x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了一段時間；高度專注工作操作能力受損。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：1.25x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderately Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been quite active for a while; operating at higher levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.67x, Active: 1.33x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了相當一段時間；較高度活動需求操作能力受損。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：1.67x，積極：1.33x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Discharge"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "你最近受到電磁脈衝的影響。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "你被閃電擊中，而且感覺...不一樣了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been very active for a while, and need to slow down for a bit.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 2.5x, Active: 2x, Brisk: 1.5x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了非常長一段時間，且需要慢下來休息。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：2.5x，積極：2x，活躍： 1.5x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been zapped with electricity and are barely able to move!"
msgstr "你被電擊了, 只能夠勉強移動!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Splattered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a little bit of acid on you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cocaine Buzz"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a mild cocaine buzz going.  Feels good, feels clean."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Splashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a small amount of acid on you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Caffeine Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've had far too much caffeine.  You feel shaky and irritable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've inhaled a lungful of glowing nether parasite spores.  Thankfully, "
"they don't seem adapted to the human physiology."
msgstr "你吸入了一肺發光的異界寄生孢子。 值得慶幸的是，它們似乎並不適應人類的生理學。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost a large amount of blood, and you're not feeling well."
msgstr "你損失了大量的血，而且感覺很不好。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost an awful lot of blood, and your condition is severe.  Seek "
"medical attention."
msgstr "你損失了非常大量的血，你的情況非常嚴重，盡快醫療處理。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost some blood and look somewhat pale."
msgstr "你失血不少且看起來蒼白。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost tremendous amount of blood, and you're standing on death's door."
"  Transfusion might save you."
msgstr "你損失了過量的血液，已經站在死亡的門前。輸血也許可以挽救你。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sludged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've stepped into some sludge!"
msgstr "你踩到了一些淤泥！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warm"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s feels warm."
msgstr "你覺得 %s 有點熱。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blisters"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is blistering from the intense heat."
msgstr "你的 %s 因高溫開始起水泡。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Scorching"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is burning up!"
msgstr "你的%s好似燒起來了！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Damp"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is covered in moisture."
msgstr "你的%s上都是濕氣。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Freezing"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is dangerously cold!"
msgstr "你的 %s 快凍僵了!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chilly"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is exposed to the cold."
msgstr "你的 %s 暴露在寒冷之中。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frostbite"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is frostbitten!  Its tissues are frozen from the cold!"
msgstr "長時間暴露於寒冷當中使你的 %s 嚴重凍傷!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frostnip"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is frostnipped and has gone numb."
msgstr "你的 %s 已經冷到凍壞且麻木了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hot"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is hot."
msgstr "你的%s非常熱。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Soaked"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is soaked!"
msgstr "你的%s被浸濕了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Defrosting"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is starting to feel the damage cold has wrought."
msgstr "你的 %s 開始感受到寒冷造成的傷害。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Uncomfortable"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your %s is uncomfortable.  Wearing something soft under your hard armor "
"would help."
msgstr "你的 %s 很不舒服。 在堅硬的護甲下方穿些柔軟的衣物會有所改善。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cold"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is very exposed to the cold."
msgstr "你的 %s 長時間暴露在寒冷之中。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wet"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is wet."
msgstr "你的%s濕透了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Opioid Painkillers"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your aches and pains don't feel as bad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands are full and ready to burst.  Ew."
msgstr "你的酸液腺已經被充滿，隨時準備噴射出去，嘔。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands got all leaky."
msgstr "你的酸液腺到處都是漏洞。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your adrenaline rush wears off.  You feel AWFUL!"
msgstr "你的腎上腺素消退。你覺得糟透了!"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your anemia is nearly resolved."
msgstr "你的貧血症狀已經快要解決了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Arm"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your arms are broken.  Your imaginary monster arms, so this is probably a "
"bug."
msgstr "你的手臂骨折了。但骨折的是你幻想的怪物手臂，所以很有可能你遇上bug了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "EM Interference"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your artificial senses are overloaded."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Weak Grasp, Inexistent Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your attacks don't seem to touch your enemies!"
msgstr "你的攻擊似乎無法碰觸到你的敵人！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Stinger"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your beautiful stinger is broken!  That must be a bug, right?"
msgstr "你漂亮的毒刺壞了！ 那一定是個bug，對嗎？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Blisters"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your blisters distract you"
msgstr "你的水泡讓你分心"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood volume increases, and you feel better; but still, you look pale."
msgstr "你的身體血液量回升，你感覺好多了；但你仍然看起來蒼白。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Alcohol Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body aches and you have chills, like you've got the flu."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chimera Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your body heaving and changing is a rough time, but what doesn't kill you "
"makes you stronger."
msgstr "你的身體艱難的變化中，但殺不死你的東西只會使你更強大。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Opioid Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is shutting down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is strangely difficult to move, as if it weighted more."
msgstr "你的身體出奇的難以移動，好像它的重量更大了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body moves strangely easily, as if it weighted less."
msgstr "你的身體移動起來異常容易，彷彿重量減輕了一般。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your breath gives out!"
msgstr "你氣喘吁吁!"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Buzzed, Tipsy, Drunk, Wasted, Dead Drunk"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Opioid Painkillers, Opioid Buzz, Opioid
#. High, Heavy Opioid High, Nodding Out, Opioid Overdose, Severe Opioid
#. Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your breathing grows weaker and weaker, and then you are gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Legs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your bugged legs are maimed beyond recognition.  How will you leap now?"
msgstr "你出bug的腿殘廢得面目全非。 現在怎麼跳？"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Capacitor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your capacitors sizzle with bioelectricity."
msgstr "你身上的電容流淌著生物電，發出光亮。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Smoke Inhalation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your chest and throat burn a little."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your chitin plating itches against your body."
msgstr "你的幾丁質外殼開始摩擦著你的身體，讓你發癢。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Claws"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your claws broke.  Like a broken nail, but somehow worse."
msgstr "你的爪子廢了。和壞掉的釘子差不多，但更糟。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your comedown throws you off."
msgstr "你彎下腰來, 吐了滿地。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your disabled body part has recovered enough for use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ears ring and your head is pounding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears, Deaf"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ears ring!"
msgstr "你耳鳴了!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unnerving symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your extremities feel numb, with occasional painful tingling and "
"convulsions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hay Fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are itchy and you've got a runny nose."
msgstr "你的眼睛發癢，不斷流著鼻涕。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are so badly inflamed that you can hardly see."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are so irritated you can barely see."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are watering."
msgstr "你淚流不止。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes burn a little."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Tear Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes burn from the tear gas."
msgstr "你的眼睛被催淚瓦斯弄得很痛。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes open to a whole new world!"
msgstr "眼前看到一片完全嶄新的世界！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Major Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes sting badly and tears stream from them continuously."
msgstr "你的眼睛劇烈刺痛，淚水不停流淌。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "隨著你的缺鐵情況改善, 你的貧血逐漸恢復中。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your iron deficiency starts to improve."
msgstr "你感覺你的缺鐵情況逐漸改善。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chimera Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is the clay of the new world.  You'll overcome all challenges."
msgstr "你的血肉是新世界的泥土。你會克服所有的挑戰。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unstable Footing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your footing is unstable.  It's more difficult to fight while standing here,"
" and you could easily stumble or fall."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your grip suddenly failed you."
msgstr "你突然抓不住了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shakes"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your hands just won't stop shaking."
msgstr "你的手無法停止顫抖。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Impaired Hearing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your hearing is impaired."
msgstr "您的聽力受到損害。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Murine Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your heart hammers away with a rapid, irregular beat."
msgstr "你的心臟不規律又急速的跳動。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Murine Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your heart pounds, knowing that predators could approach at any second!"
msgstr "你的心跳加速，你知道捕食者隨時可能靠近！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but hopefully it's not permanent yet."
msgstr "你自身的慣性已經受損，但希望它還不是永久性的。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your inertia itself is damaged, but the outcome seems suspiciously "
"beneficial."
msgstr "你自身的慣性平衡被破壞了，但結果似乎是有益的。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deflated ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are almost empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "你的墨囊幾乎空了。 它正在消耗水分，隨著時間的推移生產墨汁。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bulged ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ink glands are bulged and full.  No more ink is being created."
msgstr "你的墨囊已經完全充盈。 不再產生新的墨水。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depleted ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "你的墨囊徹底空了。 它正在消耗水分，隨著時間的推移生產墨汁。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inky glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
