"A massive, packed-together block of adobe bricks wrapped with plastic "
"packaging.  It makes for easy storage of building materials for masonry "
"constructions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "pallet of bricks"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-pallet.json
