"A ballistic glass barrier, consisting of layers of laminated glass.  Its "
"heavyweight construction is tough enough that even bullets that get through "
"are unlikely to fully shatter it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "glass wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
