#. ~ Description of "9x19mm JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds "
"have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly "
"increases stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces "
"overpenetration."
msgstr ""

