"blackpowder cartridges."
msgstr "一個皮革袋子， 穿戴於腰間以儲存並保護製作完畢的黑火藥彈夾。"

#. ~ Description of "7.62x51 belt pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
