#. ~ Description of "torso grenade bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A leather bandolier strapped around the torso for keeping 40mm grenades "
"close to hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "torso shotgun bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
