msgstr "皮革製的子彈腰帶，讓霰彈槍彈藥離手更近。"

#. ~ Description of "40mm ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A pouch consisting of four sleeves sized specifically for grenade launcher "
"ammunition.  Nylon loops across the back allow it to be attached to MOLLE "
"webbing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A pouch with individual sleeves for holding up to four hand grenades, with "
"straps for attaching it to your belt or other webbing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "military 5.56 bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A simple bag on a strap, partitioned into pouches for four STANAG 30-round "
"magazines or twelve 10-round 5.56x45mm stripper clips.  When full, this "
"bandolier is more encumbering than proper kit and slower to reload from, but"
" it at least offers a quick and cheap means of resupplying ammunition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wrist bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric bandolier for rifle cartridges, designed to be worn around "
"the wrist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pistol bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping pistol cartridges close to "
"hand.  If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."
msgstr "一條繡有花紋的皮革子彈帶，讓手槍彈藥離手更近。它一定能讓你覺得自己像個牛仔。"

