" to the sort of thing firefighters wore before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fingerless survivor gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar-armored leather gloves with the fingers cut "
"off.  These strike a balance between comfort and protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faux fur winter survivor gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of hand-crafted gloves armored with kevlar, rubberized to offer "
"protection from chemicals.  These are lined with real fur."
