"A flag divided diagonally from the upper hoist side corner to the lower fly "
"side corner, the upper triangle is red with the soaring raggiana bird and "
"the lower triangle is black with the Southern Cross of four white larger "
"five pointed stars and the smaller star."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Panamanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
