"A horizontal tricolor flag of yellow, blue, and red with its coat of arms in"
" the center."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Equatorial Guinean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag, with green, white and red stripes and a blue "
"triangle at the hoist with a coat of arms in the center."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Ethiopia flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontally running tricolor flag of green, yellow, and red, in the "
"center is a blue circle and a yellow star."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "leather flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontally striped black and blue leather flag with a white band in the "
"middle and red heart in a corner.  The black represents leather; the blue "
"represents devotion, loyalty, and community; the white represents purity and"
" innocence; and the red heart represents love for the community."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "American flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large banner decorated with red and white striped representing the "
"thirteen colonies, and fifty white stars representing the states over a "
"field of blue."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "bear flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black and orange international bear brotherhood flag.  The flag "
"displays seven horizontal stripes of colors ranging from black to brown "
"representing the colors of different bear species, you can see a black bear "
"paw in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "labrys lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black and purple labrys lesbian flag.  On the flag you can see a "
"labrys, a type of double-headed axe, superimposed on a downward-pointing "
"black triangle, set against a violet background."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "POW/MIA flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag decorated with the silhouette of a prisoner of war "
"beneath a guard tower, surrounded by barbed wire.  Text above reads, "
"\"POW*MIA\" and below, \"YOU ARE NOT FORGOTTEN\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "homemade anarchist flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag hand-painted with a white letter A, its cross, legs, and "
"head extending from the circle around it like points of a star."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "skull flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag printed with a white skull, a symbol often deployed by "
"authoritarian extremists."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "jolly roger flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag printed with the white skull and crossbones long "
"associated with piracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "molon labe flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag with a white spartan helmet printed on it beneath greek "
"letters spelling out \"MOLON LABE\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "black flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black flag with no decoration of any kind.  Perhaps unsurprisingly, "
"anarchists have had trouble settling on a single banner, but the black flag "
"endures as a symbol of outrage against the state."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "aromantic flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black, grey, white and green aromantic flag.  The green and light "
"green stripes cover everyone under the aromantic spectrum, while represents "
"nonromantic forms of love and attraction, and the gray and black represent "
"all sexualities under the aromantic spectrum."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "non-binary flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black, purple, white, and yellow non-binary flag.  Yellow for those "
"whose gender exists outside of and without reference to the binary, white "
"for those who have many or all genders, purple for those who feel their "
"gender is between or a mix of female and male, and black for those who feel "
"they are without gender."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Maine flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a moose and pine tree emblem on a shield "
"supported by a farmer and a sailor, above is the north star and the Latin "
"motto \"Dirigo\" (\"I direct\"), below the shield reads out the state of "
"\"Maine\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Vermont flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a shield with wreaths on both sides, a pine tree"
" in a green field along with a cow and bales of wheat reside within the "
"shield representing Vermont."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Connecticut flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a white baroque shield with three grapevines, "
"each bearing three bunches of purple grapes on a field of royal blue, below "
"the shield reads \"Qui Transtulit Sustinet\", which is Latin for \"He who "
"transplanted sustains\" which represents the state of Connecticut."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "New Hampshire flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag with New Hampshire's state seal of the frigate Raleigh "
"surrounded by laurel leaves and nine stars against a field of blue."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "genderfluid flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue, black, purple, white and pink genderfluid flag.  The "
"genderfluid flag has a pink stripe for femininity, a blue stripe for "
"masculinity, a purple stripe for both masculinity and femininity, a black "
"stripe for lack of gender, and a white stripe for all genders."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "polysexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue, green, and pink polysexual flag.  Pink for people on the "
"female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and green for non-"
"binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "sovereign citizen flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large flag clearly inspired by the stars and stripes of the USA, but the "
"red stripes are vertical, the blue's been swapped for white, and all the "
"stars are blue instead.  This flag is one of the symbols of a loosely "
"affiliated movement of people who believe that they are in one way or "
"another exempt from compliance with the usual laws of the land.  Given the "
"state of things, it is distinctly possible that they have had the last "
"laugh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "2A flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large flag colored a mottled taupe, like old parchment.  It is printed "
"with the full text of the second amendment of the United States constitution"
" in a font attempting to mimic the handwriting on that document.  It's kind "
"of a lot of words to put on a flag, and the fact that it's in script makes "
"it almost totally illegible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "anarchist flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large flag divided diagonally, red to the upper left, and black to the "
"lower right.  The black stands for the negation of authority and the state, "
"while the red symbolizes the blood of revolutionaries and the hope of a new "
"dawn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "prison bars flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large flag printed with something resembling the US flag, only the stripes"
" are vertical and in black and gray instead of red and blue.  They're meant "
"to look like prison bars, and a downcast man is gripping them and staring "
"plaintively from the other side."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "national flag"
#. ~ Description of "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large flag, made to fly in even the worst conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green grey and black agender flag.  The black and white stripes "
"represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-genderless,"
" and green represents non-binary gender."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "genderqueer flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green, white, and purple genderqueer flag.  Lavender, a mixture of "
"blue and pink to represent androgynes and androgyny, white to represent "
"agender identity, and green, the inverse of lavender, to represent all those"
" who fall outside of the gender binary."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green, white, grey and black agender flag.  The black and white "
"stripes represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-"
"genderless, and green represents non-binary gender.  The symmetry of the "
"pattern makes it so that it's correct no matter how it flies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "US Navy flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large navy blue flag printed with the seal of the U.S. Department of the "
"Navy, a bald eagle atop an anchor with its wings spread before a three-"
"masted sailing ship.  A gold banner beneath bears the text, \"UNITED STATES "
"NAVY\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "bisexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink and blue bisexual flag.  The pink stripe represents "
"homosexuality, while the blue stripe represents heterosexuality.  The purple"
" stripe, the \"overlap\" of the blue and pink stripes, purple represents "
"attraction regardless of sex or gender a.k.a bisexuality."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "feminism flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink flag marked with the female symbol in black, a clenched fist in"
" the middle of its central circle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "pansexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink, blue and yellow pansexual flag.  The pan-pride flag uses pink "
"for people on the female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and"
" yellow for non-binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink, white and orange lesbian flag.  The dark orange representing "
"\"gender non-conformity\", orange for \"independence\", light orange for "
"\"community\", white for \"unique relationships to womanhood\", pink for "
"\"serenity and peace\", dusty pink for \"love and sex\", and dark rose for "
"\"femininity\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large plastic trash bag with holes cut out for the head and arms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "asexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large purple, white, grey and black asexual flag.  Black for asexuality "
"(feeling no sexual attraction), grey for grey-asexuality and demisexuality "
"(feeling sexual attraction only sometimes), white for non-asexual partners "
"and allies, and purple for community."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pride flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community"
" and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "progress pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community"
" and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender.  On the left side you can "
"see a chevron that features black, brown, light blue, pink, and white "
"stripes to bring those communities to the forefront; \"the arrow points to "
"the right to show forward movement, while being along the left edge shows "
"that progress still needs to be made\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "USSR flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large red flag with a gold hammer and sickle beneath a star in the upper "
"left corner.  The tools represent the alliance between the workers and "
"peasants, while the star is the symbol of the Communist Party of the Soviet "
"Union.  The USSR fell in 1991, but for many, the flag endures as a symbol of"
" the promise (or threat) of communism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Che Guevara flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large red flag with a man's face printed on it in a graphic style, all in "
"black.  He has tousled hair and a beard, and wears a beret adorned with a "
"star."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "SPQR flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large red flag with the gold letters \"SPQR\" on it, framed by a laurel "
"wreath.  The letters stand for Senatus Populusque Romanus, a latin phrase "
"referring to the government of Rome."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "USMC flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large scarlet flag depicting the Corps emblem: A gold eagle carrying a "
"globe and anchor.  A ribbon trailing from the eagle's mouth reads \"SEMPER "
"FIDELIS\", and a larger one below the emblem reads \"UNITED STATES MARINE "
"CORPS\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "US Air Force flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large ultramarine flag decorated with thirteen stars in a ring around a "
"bald eagle above a shield.  The shield bears a stylized yellow and red "
"aircraft with eight lightning bolts radiating from it, and a banner beneath "
"reads, \"UNITED STATES AIR FORCE\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "US Army flag" of item "US organization flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag displaying the United States War Office Seal - a "
"collection of arms and armor - in blue above a red banner reading \"UNITED "
"STATES ARMY\".  At the bottom of the flag, the number 1775 commemorates the "
"year that the continental army was created."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Rhode Island flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag of Rhode Island that features a golden anchor in the "
"middle of it surrounded by thirteen gold stars, below the anchor is a blue "
"banner that reads \"hope\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "state flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "Massachusetts flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag with a shield featuring an American Native and a star "
"which represents the state of Massachusetts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "transgender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white, pink, and blue transgender flag.  The stripes at the top and "
"bottom are light blue, the traditional color for baby boys.  The stripes "
"next to them are pink, the traditional color for baby girls.  The white "
"stripe is for people that are nonbinary, feel that they don't have a gender."
"  The pattern is such that no matter which way you fly it, it is always "
"correct, signifying finding correctness in one's life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Gadsden flag" of item "protest flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large yellow flag depicting a coiled snake with its fangs bared.  Below "
"it, the words \"DONT TREAD ON ME\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "intersex flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large yellow, and purple intersex flag.  It displays a purple circle on a "
"yellow field.  Yellow and purple were chosen as colors as they were viewed "
"as free from gender associations and were historically used to represent "
"intersex people.  The circle is described as \"unbroken and unornamented, "
"symbolizing wholeness and completeness, and our potentialities\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rain poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight transparent PVC rain poncho with a hood.  It folds into a very"
" compact form when not in use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fur cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long and heavy fur cape with a hood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A long hooded cape that covers much of the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ferraiolo"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A long, crimson cape that reaches the ankles.  Worn by Catholic priests for "
"ceremonious occasions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "straw cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A long, mantled cape made of layers of dry grass strung together and "
"carefully draped over each other.  It looks like something out of a samurai "
"film."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  It is turned on, and "
"continually draining power from a UPS.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a "
"unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr "一件嵌入了攝影機與 LED 的塑膠斗篷， 穿戴並啟動後能使你對普通視覺隱形。你必須攜帶 UPS 才能使用它。\"使用\" 以切換隱形。"

#. ~ Description of variant "wizard cloak" of item "costume cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plush blue cloak with a silvery lining.  The cheap fabric is decorated "
"with glittery stars."
msgstr ""

