#. ~ Description of "shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A bulky calcareous shell, with most of the torso tucked up inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "feathers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A coat of soft plumage, growing right out of the skin to cover the head and "
"much of the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "summer coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A covering of fur that has thinned out for the summer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "patchwork armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A dense calico of scale and fur compete with variegated skin, feathers, and "
"horn buds across this armored hide."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shaggy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A heavy shag carpet of fur, somewhere between a ballistic vest and attic "
"insulation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "patchwork skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A hideous amalgam of scale, skin, and fur, knotted with osteoderms and "
"patches of shining scales."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stinger"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A hypodermic barb of glass-sharp chitin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "roomy shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A large mollusk shell, big enough for its owner to retract their body into "
"or even store a few items inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "light fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A light coat of fur growing in patches all over the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "incisors"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pair of chisel-like incisors which protrude from the upper and lower jaw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "saber teeth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pair of enormous protruding fangs, strong enough to punch through bone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of fangs sharp and sturdy enough to use in combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hooves"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pair of hard, solid hooves sheathing the unguligrade feet in a protective "
"layer of horn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fresh antlers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pair of short antlers, still covered in fuzzy velvet.  Until they're fully"
" grown in, they likely won't be much use outside of a grapple."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of short horns protruding from the scalp."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nacreous shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pearlescent mollusk shell, beautiful to behold and large enough for its "
"owner to hide inside of or store a few items."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "phelloderm"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter."
msgstr "一層柔軟又厚重的活植物物質。"

#. ~ Description of "bionic filtration system"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A powered system of filters working to keep the airways clear of dust, "
"smoke, and airborne toxins."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "protective bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful layer of bark, thicker in parts."
msgstr "一層強大的樹皮，部分比較厚。"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin right pincer"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful tool for snatching fish or breaking open shells."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "antlers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A regal pair of branching antlers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "drill beak"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A sharp, pointed beak.  The surrounding structure seems fully capable of "
"absorbing the shock of it jackhammering into wood or bone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A sheen of scales covering most of the skin.  They are tough, but remain "
"smooth and flexible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rabbit fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A soft, fluffy coating of fur.  It isn't the best protection against "
"predators, but stays warm in bad weather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crushing beak"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A stout, curved beak, like a parrot's.  It's sharp and looks like it could "
"deliver a formidable bite."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mane"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A thick ruff of fur around the throat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thick scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A tough hide plated with scales and bony ridges."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sclerotized carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A tremendous crustacean shell that covers the body in articulated plates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A warm furry hide."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tail club"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A weighty knob of fused vertebrae and osteoderms weighing down the tip of "
"the tail like a ball and chain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vampire fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A wicked pair of fangs, pointed and surgically sharp."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleek scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "An iridescent sheen of fine scales growing over the skin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Armored plates of chitin which form a hardened shell around much of the "
"body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "distributed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark evenly spread evenly across the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "latticed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark, latticed to provide strong but uneven protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "consolidated bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Bark, thicker around the trunk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cranial reinforcement"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Bolted to the bone, a set of interlocking subdermal plates protect the skull"
" and cervical vertebrae from trauma."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rigid eyestalks"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Compound eyes on rigid stalks which can fold back against the head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "curled horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Curled horns, like those of a ram."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "toe claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Curved claws adorn the feet, ideal for gripping perch and prey alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "toe talons"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Curved talons adorn the feet like sickles, perfect for the killing blow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "protective lenses"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Highly protective lenses which can retract into frames bolted right into the"
" user's skull.  They provide near-total protection for the eyes and even "
"function underwater."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Long, sharp claws at the tips of the fingers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nails"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Long, sharp fingernails, thickened and durable enough to be dangerous.  On "
"close examination, these don't quite look human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "long horns"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Long, stabbing horns protruding from the skull."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wide mouth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Most people's mouths aren't as wide as their head.  This one is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shark teeth"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Rows of jagged teeth, essentially a biological chainsaw.  They're best used "
"in deep water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sparse scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Scales, like those of a fish or a snake, grow in patches over the skin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "jumbled skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Skin like a spilled tub of paints, splattered in abstract shapes of hide, "
"fur, and scale."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fingertip razors"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Small steel blades peek from beneath the fingernails, like a manicure from "
"hell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "reticulae"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Soft, flexible scales cover the lower legs and feet.  Though not especially "
"tough, they provide some protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fresh chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"The exoskeleton is soft and vulnerable.  It would be best to hide until it "
"hardens."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleek fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a proud hunter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gray fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The shaggy fur of a wild beast."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sucker hooks"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"The suckers on the paddle-shaped feeding tentacles bear swiveling hooks of "
"wickedly sharp chitin, perfect for snaring prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mandibles"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "These are much better than puny human mouthparts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fresh sclerotized carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"This recently-molted carapace is still soft, and will need time to harden "
"before it provides proper protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "barbed tongue"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Though this tongue fits neatly within the mouth, it can extend to an "
"astonishing length.  Sharp chitin barbs like a grotesque parody of a cat's "
"tongue line the surface, and the barb at the tip looks more like a whaler's "
"harpoon than something that belongs in a mouth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "compound eyes"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Thousands of ommatidea tesselate into a pair of eyes.  Each jewel-hard "
"hexagonal lens picks up the dominant color in its field of view, rendering a"
" single pixel to the image composited by the viewer's brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ocular scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Transparent scales seal the corneas behind a firm but flexible lens.  It's "
"enough to keep water and most irritants at bay, and it would be very "
"difficult to sneak up on one who sleeps with their eyes open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "epicuticle"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Unnaturally smooth skin made of soft chitin.  Though soft and pliable, it's "
"tougher than human flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scruffy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"While still formidable, this furry hide has lost a lot of its bulk to better"
" endure the summer months."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "folding fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your fangs have properly developed, and are prepared for the kill.  They are"
" easier to use against prey that is vulnerable or webbed."
msgstr ""

