msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A durable breastplate made of thick leather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tire armor jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy leather jacket reinforced with chunks of thick rubber tire.  Thick "
"and highly resistant to blunt force."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armored riding jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty leather jacket with sheet metal plates secured over it for "
"increased protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A light jacket made of a stretch mesh covered in plastic pads meant for "
"motorcyclists.  Made to be much more comfortable to wear than leather "
"alternatives, but the underlying spandex isn't protective at all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fencing jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A padded jacket with a zipper on the back, used by fencers to prevent "
"accidents."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "carpet cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A rectangular length of tough carpet with a hole cut out for your head and "
"tied around the waist.  It's decently protective for its weight and quite "
"the fashion statement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "padded vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A sleeveless cotton shirt with fabric sewn overtop for extra protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A solid breastplate made from bronze.  It's weaker than steel, but still "
"quite protective."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plate cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A solid steel breastplate.  Even as full armor went into decline, cuirasses "
"remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hard chest guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid vest of plastic padding protecting your torso."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "underarm protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy cotton plastron that protects much of the torso, the dominant "
"shoulder, and underarm while fencing."
msgstr "一個厚實的棉胸甲，能夠在擊劍時保護大部分的軀幹、慣用肩膀、還有腋下。"

#. ~ Description of "padded sweatshirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick cotton sweatshirt with fabric sewn overtop, providing a modicum of "
"extra protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lamé"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive vest with the zipper on the back used by "
"fencers for electronic scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy "
"cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr "一見輕薄的導電背心，背後有拉鍊供擊劍運動員使用，被用來在擊劍中電子計分。它的外層由紮實的棉和不鏽鋼絲織成。"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
