#. ~ Description of "Car Buyer's Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/barter.json
msgid ""
"Normally this glossy, ad-filled magazine about cars would be pointless, but "
"it has a series of articles on haggling techniques."
msgstr "通常這種亮面雜誌充滿著無意義的汽車廣告， 但是還是有一系列關於討價還價的文章。"

#. ~ Description of "How to Succeed in Business"
#: data/json/items/book/barter.json
