msgid ""
"A home-made booklet with large black-and-white pictures of several types of "
"modern locks and general information on how to crack them open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
msgid "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid_plural "copies of MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgstr[0] "MIT的開鎖指南"

#. ~ Description of "survivor's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A hand-drawn map of the local area.  Whoever created it has marked down the "
"locations of nearby supply sources including gun stores and gas stations.  "
"Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "drainage system map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A map of sewers formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using it will "
"add sewer systems and facilities to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "subway maintenance map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A map of subway tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using "
"it will add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "trail guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed guide to the best local trails.  It has general details about the "
"trails, trailhead amenities, suggestions for the best thru-hikes, and advice"
" on interacting with local wildlife in a responsible and respectful manner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "satellite map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed satellite map of the local area.  Due to it's low quality and lack"
" of map legend, you are unable to recognize most buildings.  Using it will "
"add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "military operations map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed topographical map of the local area.  Originally of military "
"origin, it details the locations of evacuation centers and military "
"facilities.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "urban explorer's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printout of a local road map, with several buildings circled in red.  "
"Using it will add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "road map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A road map for the local area.  Listing information on civic sites like "
"hospitals and police stations, it can be used to add points of interest to "
"your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "subway map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A schematic diagram of local subway networks, too stylized to garter much "
"useful information.  Using it will add subway stations to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "technology advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local electronic and hardware stores as "
"well as arcades and internet cafes with an address below each entry.  Using "
"it will add roads and local electronic and hardware stores as well as "
"arcades and internet cafes to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "food shopping advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local food shopping possibilities with an "
"address below each entry.  Using it will add roads, local grocery, "
"convenience stores and bakeries to your map."
