"pneumatic devices, loaded with puns and dry technical diagrams.  It is "
"unclear who the audience for a book like this would be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Mechanical Mastery"
#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced guide on mechanics and welding, covering topics like \"Grinding "
"off rust\" and \"Making cursive E's\"."
msgstr "一本先進的力學和焊接指南， 涵蓋了許多其他書籍的內容。"

#. ~ Description of "Under the Hood"
#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
msgid "An advanced mechanics manual, covering all sorts of topics."
msgstr "一本深入探討機械力學的動力雜誌， 涵蓋了各種主題。"

#. ~ Description of "Hot Rod Chassis & Suspension Handbook"
