#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A clump of very large frog eggs, reeking of ammonia.  They look almost like "
"peeled grapes, except that each is the size of an orange."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "roach egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
