#. ~ Description of "chunk of mutant fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of raw fat butchered from a heavily-mutated animal.  It smells, if "
"anything, even more disgusting than the rest of the mutant.  There are "
"little puddles of unidentified oils dripping from it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of human fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid "A chunk of raw fat, harvested from a human body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of raw fat.  You could eat it as-is, but it is better used as an "
"ingredient in other foods or projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted fat"
#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted human fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A rotten glob of fat, rapidly breaking down into putrid slime and certainly "
"useless for cooking.  You could eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A smooth block of cleaned and rendered animal fat.  It will remain edible "
"for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and "
"projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mutant tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat, sourced from a mutant "
"animal.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mutant humanoid tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat, sourced from a mutant "
"humanoid.  It won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "human tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  It will remain "
"edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods "
"and projects."
msgstr "一塊光滑的白色人類脂肪, 經過了清洗和提煉。能夠保存長時間可食用, 也能搭配其他食物或製作項目。"

#. ~ Description of "coconut oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"Despite the name, coconut oil is solid at room temperature.  Smelling "
"vaguely tropical, it was popular as a natural, meat-free alternative to "
"products like shortening or lard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vegetable shortening"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"Hydrogenated vegetable oil, pure white and solid at room temperature.  This "
"product was developed in the early 20th century as an alternative to lard, "
"and can readily stand in for it in most recipes."
msgstr ""

