msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pemmican with fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Shredded dehydrated meat with bits of dried fruit for flavor, held together "
"and protected from moisture in a brick of solid fat.  This survival food was"
" first created by indigenous Americans and still remains one of the best "
"sources of shelf-stable travel-ready calories."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pemmican with vegetables"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Shredded dehydrated meat with bits of dried vegetable or mushroom for "
"flavor, held together and protected from moisture in a brick of solid fat.  "
