#. ~ Description of "dried wild rice stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of dry wild rice stalks.  Threshing these would knock the grains "
"loose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "corn cob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A corn cob full of delicious golden kernels.  You can eat them on the cob or"
" shell it for cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried buckwheat stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A heap of dried buckwheat.  It'll need to be threshed before eating, unless "
"you're a cow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wheat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A heap of dried wheatberries, ready for planting.  They're hard as gravel, "
"but could be boiled for food or ground into flour."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canola seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A heap of round black seeds, typically milled and pressed for their oil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried lentils"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A humble but nutrient-rich legume.  They should be cooked prior to "
"consumption, unless you're planning to plant them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "threshed buckwheat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A pile of buckwheat seeds with some chaff still mixed in.  Once it's "
"winnowed, it'll be ready for use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "barley"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A pile of dried barleycorn, a staple of brewing everywhere.  It can be "
"planted, boiled, or ground into flour."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "oats"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid "A pile of raw oats."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried lentil stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A pile of short stalks with lentils rattling in their pods.  These plants "
"dried in the field and didn't need a tool to harvest, but they'll still need"
" to be threshed and winnowed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "popcorn cob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A popcorn cob full of popcorn kernels.  You can eat them on the cob or shell"
" it for cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried barley stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A sheaf of dried barley stalks.  These will require threshing before "
"anything can be done with them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried oat stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
msgid ""
"A sheaf of dried oat stalks.  These will require threshing before anything "
"can be done with them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dried wheat stalks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
