"A large capacity handgun, chambered in .22 and feeding from quad stack "
"magazines.  Used both recreationally and in competition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A light and handy .22 LR handgun from Ruger, this handgun is one of the most"
" popular .22 handguns ever created."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low "
"power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high "
"customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular "
"varmint rifle amongst civilian shooters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint pistol"
#. ~ Description of "full-auto varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight varmint pistol, modified to fire both semi, and full auto."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "pump action varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with "
"an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can"
" be made in calibers such as .22 LR."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a "
"pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer "
"components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is"
" not very powerful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Henry
#. Golden Boy rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Henry Golden Boy rifle" of item "small game
#. lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Henry Golden Boy features an 20\" "
"octagonal barrel with 16 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is "
"loaded from the front of the rifle.  It fairly resembles the original Henry "
"Model 1860 with its brass colored receiver, though with wooden furniture at "
"the front, and without a doubt using modern manufacturing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi Rio
#. Bravo rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Rio Bravo rifle" of item "small game lever-
#. action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Rio Bravo features an 18\" barrel "
"with 15 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front "
"of the rifle.  The mechanical origins date back decades, being based off of "
"Rossi's R92 series of rifles which themselves were based off of the "
"Winchester 1892."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "pump action varmint rifle" of gun "Rossi Gallery
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Gallery rifle" of item "pump action varmint
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modern take on the Winchester 1890, the Rossi Gallery is a .22 LR rifle, "
"notably using a pump action.  Much like a pump action shotgun, the magazine "
"tube is below it's 18 inch barrel and can hold 15 rounds.  While pump "
"actions are quite often associated with shotguns, the mechanism can be "
"applied to rifles as well, though in practice it's limited to .22 LR."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W target pistol"
#. ~ Description of "S&W target pistol"
