#. ~ Description of variant "Chiappa Rhino revolver" of item ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"An innovative, futuristic looking revolver designed by Emilio Ghisoni after "
"developing the Mateba, its most distinctive feature is its barrel, aligned "
"with the bottom chamber of its hexagonal cylinder to alleviate muzzle flip."
"  This positions the bore lower relative to the sights, effectively making "
"the gun easier to shoot but harder to aim."
msgstr ""

