#. ~ Description of gun "homemade pistol"
#. ~ Description of "homemade pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A large and heavy pistol evidently welded from scrap.  It's not pretty, but "
"the .45 it's chambered with packs a serious punch.  Just watch out for the "
"kick."
msgstr "一把拼裝而成的笨重手槍。外表並不美觀, 但它 .45 口徑的威力不容小覷。另外要注意的是他的後座力。"

#. ~ Description of gun "UMP submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "UMP submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A modern polymer-body sub-machine gun, once quite popular with police "
"departments until recently.  Can be configured in 9x19mm, .40 S&W, or .45 "
"ACP using conversion kits and the appropriate UMP magazine."
msgstr ""

