#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"A beautifully decorated flintlock pistol.  If using this doesn't make you "
"feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr "一把裝飾精美的燧發手槍。如果拿著它都無法讓你感受到當海盜的fu， 那就沒別種東西有辦法了。"

#. ~ Description of gun "handmade double-barrel flintlock"
#. ~ Description of "handmade double-barrel flintlock"
#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"A compact muzzle-loading rifle combining a pair of rudimentary flintlock "
"actions and two barrels.  Whereas an antique multiple-barrel flintlock is an"
" intricate work of gunsmithing, this weapon is simpler yet still "
"serviceable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock rifle"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"Also called a Pennsylvania rifle, this long-barreled rifled flintlock gun "
"has significantly increased accuracy at the cost of taking even longer to "
"reload."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock musket"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock musket"
#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"For once, something *good* came back from the dead.  This ancient design "
"lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as much punch as the best "
"of 'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr "這一次, 不一樣的 \"好\" 東西回來了。這種古老的設計缺乏現代武器的擊發效率, 但是彈藥製作簡單, 對於訓練有素的射手來說還算可以接受。"

#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock carbine"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"This short rifle design once dominated the battlefields of ancient Europe, "
"and may yet re-earn its feared status due to its ease of handling and "
"ability to use easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr "這把短來福槍的設計在古代歐洲的戰場曾經佔盡優勢, 因為它好操控, 而且彈藥也很容易製作, 現在它也許可以贏回過往的榮耀。"

