#. ~ Description of gun mod "match trigger"
#. ~ Description of "match trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's "
"accuracy."
msgstr "精密加重的扳機組件，可略微提高槍械的準確性。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple modification of some of a TEC-9's internal fire-control "
"components, converting it to a fully-automatic-only machine pistol.  Calling"
" this hilariously illegal would be an understatement, but anyone who'd care "
"is probably long gone by now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Glock auto sear plate"
#. ~ Description of "Glock auto sear plate"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate "
"of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  "
"A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This "
"will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "M240 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M240 select fire trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
