"A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a "
"pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become "
"selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as "
"actual full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr ""

