#. ~ Description of "KA-BAR knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"The KA-BAR was developed by the United States Marine Corps in 1942 by "
"modifying hunting knife designs to be more soldier-proof.  The handle is "
"made of stacked leather washers, and the blade is made of easy to sharpen "
"high steel, making for a popular fighting, hunting and utility knife.  The "
"blade is marked 'USMC'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"The current issue Army bayonet, before the Cataclysm anyways.  It is thick, "
"heavy, and surprisingly sharp.  This bayonet also functions as a wire "
"cutter, and a mediocre saw for cutting through aircraft fuselage.  That the "
"handle and tang can be completely disassembled from the blade is surely a "
"fact of great comfort to the soldier, survivalist, and you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bread knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"This knife has quite a long blade with a scalloped edge for cutting bread.  "
"It's not that sharp, but its length and heft mean it could do a bit of "
"damage and cause some nasty tearing."
msgstr "這把刀有著相當長用來切麵包的鋸齒刀刃。它不怎麼鋒利但是它的長度重量使它能夠造成一些傷害和陰險的撕裂傷。"

#. ~ Description of "survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"This large knife looks scary at first, but its hollow handle, the compass "
"built into its pommel, and the saw teeth along the spine reveal that it's "
"more of a novelty for wannabe survivalists."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a modern take on a traditional weapon that "
"originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved edge, "
"it can be used as both a tool and a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kris"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"This wavy-bladed dagger is from Southeast Asia.  The design of the blade "
"causes it to make broad, painful wounds."
msgstr ""

