msgid "M14 land mine"
msgid_plural "M14 land mines"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description of "broken glass trap"
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"Same glass shard as before, now prepared to be spread on the ground. It will"
" make noise when stepped on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nailboard trap"
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"Several pieces of wood nailed together, with some nails sticking straight "
"up.  If an unsuspecting victim steps on it, they'll get nails through the "
"foot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ bury trap message of item "bear trap"
