#. ~ Description of monster "prototype cyborg"
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A human fused with a mess of metal parts and wires.  While their eyes are "
"empty, the flashes of pain that occasionally cross their face remind you "
"that, deep down, there is a person still trapped in this grotesque body.  "
"Someone with enough surgical skills might be able to restore some of their "
"humanity, but they'd first need to subdue them somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cyborg"
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"This walking corpse is riddled with the broken promises of next-gen biotech."
"  Its flesh has gone black around the edges of its bionic armor plating, and"
" its unpowered implants now serve only as dead weight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "prototype cyborg"
msgid_plural "prototype cyborgs"
msgstr[0] "原型生化人"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/cyborgs.json
msgid "zombie cyborg"
msgid_plural "zombie cyborgs"
msgstr[0] ""

