#. ~ Description of monster "triclopean dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid ""
"A rather average looking dog until you notice the third eye, right on its "
"forehead, covered by a thick eyelid.  Whenever its open, small particles of "
"dust from the ground rise and swirl around it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "iridescent cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid ""
"As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't "
"make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "liquid cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid ""
"It is universally known that cats are liquid, but this cat's body is "
"actually quivering while it walks around.  It also enjoys resting while "
"twisting its body in ways that would break a normal cat's bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "void cat"
#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
msgid ""
"Seeing how unnaturally dark this black cat's fur is, you are certain this is"
" no ordinary cat.  Its fur seems to absorb light from the surroundings."
msgstr ""

