msgid "Skin tone: light"
msgstr "膚色：淺色"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: light brown"
msgstr "膚色：淺棕色"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: rose"
msgstr "膚色：玫瑰色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: chin strap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a beard along the jaw lines, circling the chin, and no moustache."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: neckbeard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a beard formed from hair grown on neck below the chin line.  No "
"moustache included."
msgstr "你的鬍子從下巴線下面長到脖子上，沒有上唇髭鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: bronze"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a bronze or tan skin tone."
msgstr "你的膚色為古銅色或黃褐色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: dark brown"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a dark brown skin tone."
msgstr "你的膚色是深棕色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: chin curtain"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a full beard without a moustache, restricted to the chin, sometimes"
" called a 'lion's mane'. Much like Abraham Lincoln's beard."
msgstr "你留著整齊的鬍鬚，沒有上唇髭鬚，只有下巴有，有時被稱為“獅子的鬃毛”。 很像亞伯拉罕·林肯的鬍鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: Van Dyke"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a handlebar moustache with a chin strip or a small goatee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: gunslinger beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a horseshoe moustache and disconnected sideburns."
msgstr "你有馬蹄鐵鬍鬚，以及不相連的兩鬢鬍鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: light brown"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a light brown skin tone."
msgstr "你的膚色是淺棕色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: light"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a light peach skin tone."
msgstr "你的膚色是淺桃色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: soul patch"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a little bit of hair in the dip under your lower lip, and no other "
"facial hair whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: long beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a long beard, that goes down to your chest.  Somewhat reminiscent "
"of Santa's moustache."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: walrus"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a long thick moustache, overshadowing your lips, that somewhat "
"resembles the facial hair of a walrus."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: anchor beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a beard starting with a strip going down from the "
"bottom lip, then tracing the jaw lines.  It looks a bit like an anchor, thus"
" the name."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚以及沿著下頜輪廓的帶尖鬍鬚。它看起來有點像錨，因此得名。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a long beard, both formed by allowing free growth "
"of hair, with no particular styling."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚和長長的下頷鬍鬚，都是讓毛髮自由生長而形成的，沒有特殊的造型。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: royale beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard forming a patch under your lips."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚和條狀的下頜鬍鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: short boxed beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard with trimmed sides.  Thin patches "
"connect them both, forming a 'box' around the lips, thus the name."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚和雙側邊削薄的短下頜鬍鬚，修薄整齊的鬍線在嘴唇形成一個箱子狀，因此得名。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: circle beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard, that both form a circle around your "
"lips."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚和下頜處鬍鬚，分布在你的嘴唇周圍構成一個圓形。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: chevron moustache"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a moustache that covers your entire top lip."
msgstr "你有濃密的上唇髭鬚覆蓋住整片上唇。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: handlebar moustache"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a moustache with long flared out ends."
msgstr "你有很長向外擴張端的上唇髭鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: horseshoe"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache with patches going down the chin from both ends, thus "
"the name."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚，它的兩端往下延伸到下巴，成馬蹄鐵狀，因此得名。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: original moustache"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache with shortened ends, that covers only the skin above "
"your upper lip."
msgstr "你有上唇髭鬚修剪成較短，只覆蓋住上唇皮膚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: rose"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a rosy pink skin tone."
msgstr "你的膚色是紅潤粉色。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: goatee"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a short beard at the tip of your chin."
msgstr "你的下巴尖端有短鬍鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: chin strip"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a short beard in a form of a vertical patch under your bottom lip."
msgstr "你有沿著下頜的垂直線狀短鬍鬚。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: 3-day stubble"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a short trimmed moustache and beard imitating a 3-day stubble."
msgstr "你有修剪成短的上唇髭鬚跟下頷鬍鬚，模擬成剛長 3天的樣子。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: very long beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a very long beard, that goes down to your waist, like wise old "
"mentors have."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: pencil moustache"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a very thin moustache just above the line of the upper lip."
msgstr "你有非常薄的上唇髭鬚，剛好在上嘴唇上方形成一條線。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: The Zappa"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a wide soul patch and a full moustache that extends a bit downwards"
" at the corners of your lips."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: amber" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have amber eyes."
msgstr "琥珀色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: blue" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have blue eyes."
msgstr "藍色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: brown" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have brown eyes."
msgstr "棕色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: gray" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have gray eyes."
msgstr "灰色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: green" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have green eyes."
msgstr "綠色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eye color: hazel" of mutation"Eye color"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have hazel eyes."
msgstr "黃褐色眼睛。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: mutton chops beard"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have long sideburns that connect to your moustache, with the tip of the "
"chin shaven clean."
msgstr "你有很長的兩鬢鬍鬚，連接到了你的上唇鬍鬚，下巴的尖端剃的很乾淨。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: none"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have no hair on your face, it is shaven or simply untouched by the "
"presence of hair."
msgstr "你臉上沒有毛髮，可能剃掉了，或只是單純不長毛髮而已。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facial hair: sideburns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have patches of hair in front of your ears, that normally would connect "
"your hair with the beard, but they are here by themselves."
msgstr ""

