"in.  I had a lot of stuff saved up there.  But I suppose it wouldn't matter "
"much now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Okay, calm down…"
