msgstr "好。你剛才說的是什麼？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Hey, I'd really be interested in seeing those maps."
msgstr ""

