#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"--ACCESS GRANTED--\n"
"Mission Complete!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "聯絡我們"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Disable External Power"
msgstr "停用外置電源"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Emergency Message."
msgstr "緊急訊息"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"GREETINGS CITIZEN.  A BIOLOGICAL ATTACK HAS TAKEN PLACE AND A STATE OF EMERGENCY HAS BEEN DECLARED.  EMERGENCY PERSONNEL WILL BE AIDING YOU SHORTLY.  TO ENSURE YOUR SAFETY PLEASE FOLLOW THE STEPS BELOW.\n"
" 1. DO NOT PANIC.\n"
" 2. REMAIN INSIDE THE BUILDING.\n"
" 3. SEEK SHELTER IN THE BASEMENT.\n"
" 4. USE PROVIDED GAS MASKS.\n"
" 5. AWAIT FURTHER INSTRUCTIONS."
msgstr ""
"各位市民，此地已遭受生物恐怖攻擊，政府已宣布進入緊急狀態，災害應變人員將急速前往協助您，為確保您的安全，請確實遵照下列步驟：\n"
" 1. 切勿恐慌。\n"
" 2. 留在室內。\n"
" 3. 進入地下室避難。\n"
" 4. 戴上配給的防毒面具。\n"
" 5. 耐心等待進一步的指示。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Log off."
msgstr "離開"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Make a note of the location."
msgstr "記下所在地。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Press any key."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"REFUGEE CENTER FOUND!  IF YOU HAVE ANY FEEDBACK CONCERNING YOUR VISIT PLEASE CONTACT\n"
" THE DEPARTMENT OF EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT PUBLIC AFFAIRS OFFICE.\n"
" THE LOCAL OFFICE CAN BE REACHED BETWEEN THE HOURS OF 9AM AND\n"
" 4PM AT 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK WITH SOMEONE IN PERSON OR WOULD LIKE\n"
"TO WRITE US A LETTER PLEASE SEND IT TO…"
msgstr ""
"找到難民中心！如果您對此次的訪問有任何意見與回饋，\n"
"請聯繫緊急應變管理部公共事務辦公室，\n"
"當地辦事處服務時間上午9點到下午4點，\n"
"聯絡電話 555-0164\n"
"\n"
"如果您想進行專人諮詢的話，或者是想要\n"
"寫信給我們，我們的地址是..."

