#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"Gov assigns names based off numerological conversions of house numbers.  "
"Robert Williamson: 205 W Orchard Avenue.  Robert (78) + Williamson (127) = "
"205.  Despite the beautiful weather, he keeps the curtains closed and no one"
" has even visited yet.  And he's been here for more than two weeks!  I only "
"ever see him when he's coming or going from work.  I assume it's work, even "
"if the hours are strange sometimes.  Black car, out of state plates, looks "
"brand new.  Fed behavior, if you ask me… Is he actually going somewhere or "
"just trying to convince me he's legitimate?  Is he on the job when he leaves"
" or on the job when he's here?  Further investigation required."
