msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't "
"here to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and "
"that's giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a "
"box.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "Well then, what does it cost to hire you."
msgstr "那麼，僱傭你要多少錢。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "Well whatever."
msgstr "好吧，隋你便。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "[12 HGC] You have a deal."
msgstr "[12 Hub 01 金幣] 我們成交。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid ""
"&<mypronoun> quickly removes the offending piece of meat from your hand and "
"places two golden coins on the table, apparently unshaken by the prospect of"
" meeting someone who casually visits bars while carrying cuts of human "
"flesh.  \"Now if you please, I have a meal to get rid of.\" <mypronoun> "
"says, between poorly masked bouts of nausea."
