#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ An experienced survivor doing low importance work for Hub 01, or working
#. under another ancillary. Has no access to Hub 01s custom gear.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NC_ANCILLA_GRUNT.json
msgid "Fighting in the name of Hub 01 and money, mostly money."
msgstr "為了Hub 01 和金錢而戰，主要是錢。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Ahh but if you want suggestions and are one for craft beers, I certainly "
"suggest having some old world brew before it all goes flat or sour."
msgstr "阿，如果你想獲得些建議而且你懂酒，我當然建議在舊世界的酒變酸或者平淡前先喝掉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also good for a chat if you don't want anything."
msgstr "即使你沒啥想要的，來和我聊聊天也不錯。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also have some old world sodas if alcohol isn't your kind of thing."
msgstr "如果你不喜歡酒精飲料，這裡也有些舊世界的汽水。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"And you can also try chatting with some of the other patrons if networking "
"is your thing."
msgstr "如果你是那種社交趴，你也可以試著和其他酒客聊聊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Any good rumors?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Can also sell some dry foods if you want to stock for a trip somewhere."
msgstr "如果你想要長途旅行，我也能賣你些乾糧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "I'll ask around, thank you."
msgstr "我會四處問問，謝了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'll be going…"
msgstr "我該走了..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"If what you want are jobs and opportunities, you'll probably be better off asking to my other patrons.  Have regulars from well across the state, I'm sure some can offer what you want.\"\n"
"\n"
" \"Really, I just tend the bar and don't ask many questions.  Things tend work out better that way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just bought some of this new \"Free Whiskey\" from the caravaneer up above."
"  It's vile if you ask me, but it packs a good punch.  A real drink of the "
"apocalypse I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Just some water."
msgstr "來點水就好了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just the best spirits the whole of New England has to offer.  Well the best we've managed to loot so far at least.\n"
"\n"
" <ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Let me see what you keep behind the counter."
msgstr "讓我來看看你藏了什麼在櫃檯後面。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Not much fruit juice to make fancy drinks, but I can scrounge up some still."
msgstr "果汁並不多，沒法弄出太多花式飲品，不過我仍然想辦法弄到一些。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Oh yes of course, think this should be all, well that's all there is anyhow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "On second thought, don't bother."
msgstr "我再想想， 抱歉打擾。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Speaking off, Cranberry here brought me a whole cask of Cabernet a few days "
"ago.  So if red wines are your thing I can offer that by the gallon."
msgstr "話說回來，Cranberry前幾天給我帶了一整桶卡本內蘇維葡萄酒。如果你對紅酒有興趣，我可以按加侖提供。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"The water I boiled from a pool by the rails, so I don't suggest you get "
"some."
msgstr "這裡的水是我從鐵軌附近的水池煮出來的，所以我不太建議你買。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "There should be a package for me here."
msgstr "這裡應該有個給我的包裹。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Terminal, scavenger, longest standing underground bar in the "
"state.  Feel free to ask if you need something."
msgstr "歡迎來到終點站，拾荒者，本洲最歷史悠久的地下酒吧。如果你需要什麼，儘管問。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "What do you have on tap?"
msgstr "你這裡有什麼現成的酒?"

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$2] Just some water."
msgstr "[$2] 來點水就好了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] Get me a cup of red wine"
msgstr "[$3] 給我一杯紅酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a beer"
msgstr "[$3] 我要一份啤酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of rum"
msgstr "[$3] 我要一杯蘭姆酒。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of whiskey"
msgstr "[$3] 給我一杯威士忌。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"A few of us joined up to make this a safe house, and it's just my turn "
"watching the gates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Getting paid for standing around.  And you are getting in the way."
msgstr "我領薪水在這站哨。然後你在這礙事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "I'm just on watch, move along."
msgstr "我就是個站哨的，快離開。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"If you are looking for the Terminal, it's in the first basement, right down "
"the stairs and to the left."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your team?"
msgstr "有辦法讓我加入你們的隊伍嗎？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just go down to the Terminal if you want in."
msgstr "你想進去的話，直接下樓到終點站那。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just making sure people don't ask stupid questions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Me?  Just standing around, looking scary.  Think I'm doing a good job?\n"
"\n"
"Don't answer that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Well you certainly look like you could.  Try ringing the box in the bunker "
"across the street, or see if someone in the Terminal has a need for help."
msgstr "你看起來當然可以。試著按一下對面碉堡裡的對講機，或者看看終點站那是否有人需要幫忙。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Generic Mercenary Guard for the ancilla hq.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "mercenary"
msgstr "傭兵"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Andrea Dzvonko"
msgstr "Andrea Dzvonko"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid ""
"Hold on, hold on.  I'm not here to hurt anyone, and there aren't enough of "
"us left to just start fighting."
msgstr "等等，等等，我不想傷害任何人，我們這些活下來的人已經不夠再開啟一場戰鬥了。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how
#. melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Hub 01 Software Engineer"
msgstr "Hub 01 軟體工程師"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Software Engineer" NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how
#. melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "I work for Hub 01 as a software engineer."
msgstr "我是Hub 01的軟體工程師。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too."
msgstr "很高興見到你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Who the fuck are you?  How did you get down here?  Security!"
msgstr "你他媽的是誰？你怎麼到這裡的？保全！"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "software engineer"
msgstr "軟體工程師"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Darla Novak"
msgstr "Darla Novak"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from
#. choking on stale bunker air.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance"
msgstr "Hub 01 空調維護員"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from
#. choking on stale bunker air.
#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Server Maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "I'm part of Hub 01's maintenance crew."
msgstr "我是Hub 01維護組的一員。"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "building maintenance"
msgstr "建築維護工"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a
#. company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Hub 01 Assistant"
msgstr "Hub 01 助手"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Assistant" NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a
#. company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "I do miscellaneous jobs within Hub 01."
msgstr "我在Hub 01做些打雜的事情。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Jonathan Farrier"
msgstr "Jonathan Farrier"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "assistant"
msgstr "助手"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Hub 01 Server Maintenance"
msgstr "Hub 01 伺服器維護員"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Sunil Narayana"
msgstr "Sunil Narayana"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "server maintenance"
msgstr "伺服器維護員"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&An intercom is embedded into the wall here, just next to the card reader.  "
"It's a metal box about as big as a dinner plate, with a speaker shaped like "
"a downwards curve and a large camera prominently featured in the center.  "
"You see a single metal button with a dark LED next to it.  The intercom is "
"silent."
msgstr ""
"&這面牆上嵌入了一個對講機，就在讀卡機旁。看起來就像個餐盤大的金屬盒子，伸出一個向下彎曲的麥克風，中間是個攝影鏡頭。你看到一個金屬按鈕旁有個熄滅的LED燈。對講機現在沒有發出聲響。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom crackles with static as it turns on.  The LED next to the "
"button lights up a bright red, and the camera lens whirrs as it focuses on "
"you.  There is no immediate response."
msgstr "&對講機發出靜電干擾的霹啪聲啟動了。按鈕旁的LED亮起紅色的燈，攝影機的鏡頭發出呼呼聲並聚焦在你身上。但目前沒有任何直接的回應。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom erupts into static.  Then, it resolves into a voice.  It "
"clears its throat, then speaks slowly and carefully.  \"Understood.  There "
"is a tray embedded beneath the intercom.  Please place the drive into it.\""
"  On cue, a small portion of the wall beneath the intercom slides out along "
"rails, revealing a large tray several inches deep.  \"You are welcome to "
"leave afterwards.\""
msgstr ""
"&對講機忽然靜下了。然後，它變了一個一聲音。他清了清嗓子然後慢慢且小聲的說。\"知道了。對講機下方有個托盤，請把硬碟放在裡面。\" "
"在提示下，對講機下方的一小部分牆壁沿著軌道滑出，露出一個幾英吋深的托盤。\"之後請你離開這裡。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom hisses.  A voice of indeterminate sex speaks flatly.  \"I "
"don't know who you are or how you got to this location, but we have nothing "
"to gain from one another.  If you have a reason to be here, then please "
"state your business.  Otherwise, please leave the area.\""
msgstr ""
"&對講機發出嘶嘶聲。一個性別不明的聲音平淡的說道。\"我不知道你是誰，也不知道你怎麼道這兒來的，但我們之間沒有任何關係。如果你有理由來這兒，請說明你的來意。不然，請離開這裡。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom is silent."
msgstr "&對講機沉默不語。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The tray slides shut.  \"Thank you.\"  The intercom turns off without "
"another word."
msgstr "&托盤滑動並關上了。\"謝謝你。\" 對講機沒有說其他訊息便關閉了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "About that hard drive…"
msgstr "關於那個硬碟..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "And the trading we agreed on?"
msgstr "那麼之前談好的交易呢？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ask Gavin."
msgstr "去問Gavin。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Certainly.  I've just finished speaking with a certain individual, who has "
"authorized you limited access to a selection of our internal stores.  We "
"will provide you with pay for contracts in the form of tokens to be used as "
"an exchange currency, which you can then trade for goods.  We are also "
"amenable to bartering in exchange for supplies that are currently difficult "
"for us to obtain from outside the facility, and are especially interested in"
" any…especially unusual items you may find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't do anything stupid."
msgstr "別做傻事。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't loiter."
msgstr "別閒晃了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Get with it."
msgstr "去幹活吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Hold on, who are you?  And what do you want with the data?"
msgstr "等等，你們是誰？你們要這些數據做什麼？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I don't have the drive with me right now; I'll give it to you when I have "
"it."
msgstr "我現在沒帶著硬碟；等我拿到了就給你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I have a delivery from the Free Merchants.  You requested a hard drive from "
"them."
msgstr "我這裡有份從自由商會來的快遞。你們讓他們送了個硬碟來。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I have to go."
msgstr "我該走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I promise you, there is nothing you can do for us.  Now leave, before I'm "
"forced to-\"  They stop suddenly.  You hear a short, muffled conversation "
"from the other end.  There's a brief pause.  \"Alright.  We might be able to"
" gain some mutual benefit.  It's a dangerous task, but if you complete it "
"then we would be willing to open up limited trading access."
msgstr ""
"我敢保證，你幫不了我們。立刻離開，不然我就－\"聲音忽然停了。你聽到另外一端傳來一陣短暫低沉的對話。一個短暫的停頓後。\"好吧，也許我們能找到一些雙贏的方式。這裡有項危險的任務，如果你能夠完成的話，我們可以和你進行一些有限的交易。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind.  Let's get down to business."
msgstr "我會記在心上。我們開始談談正事吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'm just looking for valuables.  Maybe we can trade?"
msgstr "我只是路過來找些值錢貨。也許我可以和你們做點交易？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "嗯，我在聽。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "If/you speak to/understand… you/me. Yes?"
msgstr "如果你想理解....你和我。是吧？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "It's the apocalypse out here!  Please just let me in!"
msgstr "外面是世界末日！請讓我進去！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Let's discuss contracts."
msgstr "我們來談談合約的事。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Look, there must be something we can work out."
msgstr "聽著，一定有些方案是我們可以談的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "快點兒。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Mercenary."
msgstr "傭兵。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Oh!  Good.  We had written that off as a non-starter.  Just drop it into the"
" tray and we'll bring it in."
msgstr "喔！好吧。無可奉告。把它放到托盤裡就是了，我們會處理。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Please don't bother us senselessly."
msgstr "請不要無謂的打擾我們。"

#. ~ Job description of "intercom" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Reading this line is a bug"
msgstr "看到這行表示程式出錯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Right.  Your handling of this situation was exemplary, and it's clear to us "
"that we greatly underestimated our potential for mutual benefit.  If you are"
" interested, we are willing to offer you more work going forward, and all of"
" it will have proper compensation from now on."
msgstr ""
"是的。你對現場的處理情況令人印象深刻，顯然我們之前大大的低估了互利互惠的潛力。如果你有興趣的話，我們願意為你提供更多任務，而且從現在起所有的任務都將有適當的補償。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Risk my neck for the privilege of trading with you?  Maybe another time."
msgstr "為了和你交易的特權而冒我的險？下次再說吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say again?"
msgstr "再說一次？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say it."
msgstr "說吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "So, do you need something?"
msgstr "那麼，你需要什麼嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Sorry, forgot to grab the drive.  I'll return with it."
msgstr "抱歉，我忘了帶硬碟了。我會帶著它回來。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Speak slowly and clearly.  Please."
msgstr "說慢點，清楚點。麻煩你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Thank you.  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "感謝你。你還需要什麼嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"The merchant at the refugee center sent me.  You were looking for a hard "
"drive from them?"
msgstr "難民中心的商人派我來的。你們在找他們的硬碟？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"The traders at the refugee center asked me to deliver this drive of FEMA "
"data…"
msgstr "難民中心的商人要我把這份FEMA數據交給你們..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "The traders mentioned you were looking for help."
msgstr "商會還說你們正在尋找幫手。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ugh, I hate intercom duty… oh, um.  Hello."
msgstr "呃，我討厭值對講機的班...喔，嗯。你好。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Um, can anyone hear me?"
msgstr "呃，有人能聽到我說話嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "等等，什麼？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "We look forward to working with you."
msgstr "我們期待著與你再次合作。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "好？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What am I getting out of this?"
msgstr "我能從中得到什麼？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What's up with the interference in this thing?"
msgstr "怎麼總是來打擾我們？"

#. ~ Reason for a shopkeeper blacklist entry
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Will not buy back their own gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Yes, mercenary?"
msgstr "是的？傭兵？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You do realize that the front door is just open?"
msgstr "你知道前門已經打開了嗎？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"You may rarely come across certain items which have been affected by "
"the…ongoing phenomena.  They may seem like mundane household objects, but "
"exhibit properties which seem to defy casual explanation.  I'm afraid that "
"we cannot be clearer on this matter - suffice to say that you will likely "
"know it when you see it.  We are willing to barter for these items at a high"
" value."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned wanting unusual items?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned you had a map of the area?"
msgstr "你提過你們有這個區域的地圖？"

#. ~ Refusal reason for a shop item group
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You're not yet qualified to buy this"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Bang on the metal door.]"
msgstr "[敲打金屬門。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Hand over the FEMA data.]"
msgstr "[交出FEMA數據]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Identify yourself before the intercom.]"
msgstr "[在對講機前表明身份。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Press the button.]"
msgstr "[按下按鈕]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"[Tap the camera lens.]  Look, I know someone's listening.  What is this "
"place?"
msgstr "[敲敲攝影機鏡頭。]聽著，我知道裡面有人正在聽著。這裡是什麼地方？"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "the intercom"
msgstr "對講機"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "…Hello?"
msgstr "...哈囉？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"\"Other dangers\" is a little vague.  Do you have anything more substantial?"
msgstr "\"其他危險\"聽起來也太含糊了。有更詳細的說明嗎？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you calmly detail the events at the facility: the unexpected zombie presence underground, the anomalous nature of the experiment floor, and the encounter with the warped and hostile research staff trapped in the corridor.  Throughout, the voice interjects with questions, the sounds of typing filling the pauses.\n"
"\n"
"\"We appreciate your thorough report,\" the voice finally responds.  \"Your handling of the circumstances was commendable considering the anomalous and unpredictable nature of the facility.  If you seek further contract work, rest assured, we'll take into account the potential for anomalous circumstances in future assignments and relay them accordingly.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you explain what happened at the ruins: the zombie presence and gigantic tendrils on the surface, and the biological infestation completely taking over the basement, as well as the hostile threats encountered therein.  The voice periodically interjects with questions or statements; the whole time, you hear the sounds of typing on a keyboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"We would like to extend our thanks for your detailed report.  It is clear to us that the threat level present at the manufacturer was far higher than we had originally anticipated, and your performance in the situation was exemplary.  Should you desire further contract work, we will bear these facts in mind, and ensure that the threat prognoses of your future assignments are adequately assessed.\""
msgstr ""
"&在幾分鐘的時間裡，你解釋了廢墟中發生的事情：大量的殭屍和巨大的觸手，完全佔領地下室的生化感染，還有更多敵意威脅目標。對講機對面的聲音不時地插入問題或描述；整個過程中你一直聽到鍵盤敲擊的聲音。\n"
"\n"
"\"我們要感謝你的詳細報告。這表明了製造廠的威脅等級遠遠高出我們的預期，而在這樣情況下你的表現堪稱典範。如果之後你希望獲得更多契約，我們將牢記此次經歷，並確保對你未來任務的威脅進行充分評估。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom is silent for a few seconds while the tray slides back in.  "
"\"Yes it is.  It's unfortunate that only the data was salvageable, but you "
"have our thanks for returning it nonetheless.\""
msgstr "&對講機沉默了幾秒，托盤滑了回去。\"是的，就是這個。不幸的是只有數據是可回收的，不過還是非常感謝你將它帶回來。\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"We expected nothing less.  We hope you found the hm12's performance to be satisfactory.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.  After a pause, the voice on the other end sighs.\n"
"\n"
"\"…we requested that the subject remain intact.  This outcome is… unfortunate.  We will process the specimen, but it is unlikely that it will yield usable information as to its purpose.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You may keep the dazzle rifle.  You are dismissed.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom waits patiently."
msgstr "&對講機耐心的等待。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom's tray slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is the case; thank you.  Transferring the stipulated amount now.\"  The tray slides back open with your payment.  \"As an additional form of payment, you have been given clearance to receive a map of the area around this site, to assist in your work.  The standing price is 1 HGC; please inform us if you'd like to follow up on that offer going forward."
msgstr ""
"&對講機滑動托盤並且關閉。\n"
"\n"
"\"就是這個箱子；感謝你。現在將把說好數字給你。\"托盤又滑開了，裡面放著你的酬勞，\"做為額外的獎勵部分，你現在有權購買附近的完整地圖，用來協助我們工作。標準價格為1個Hub 01金幣；如果你對此有興趣，請告訴我們。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The voice hesitates.  \"About that.  Give me a moment.\"  After a pause, "
"you hear muffled back-and-forth conversation.  You can't make out what's "
"being said, but you can make out at least two other distinct voices."
msgstr "&聲音猶豫了一下。\"關於這個。給我點時間。\"停頓片刻後，你聽到低沉的來回對話。你聽不清楚他們在說什麼，但你至少能分辨出兩個不同的聲音。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The voice on the other side of the intercom is silent with disbelief."
msgstr "&對講機那一邊鴉雀無聲，似乎難以置信。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"About that.\"  You hear papers shuffling.  \"Our drones are unable to "
"approach the structure too closely, as a large amount of interference "
"prevents surveillance, but long-distance measurements reveal a high "
"concentration of toxic compounds in the air, as well as densely-clustered "
"heat signatures.  We expect a high concentration of undead, and other "
"dangers are likely."
msgstr ""
"關於這個嘛。\"你聽到翻閱文件的聲音。\"我們的無人機無法靠大樓太近，有大量的干擾妨礙了監視，但長距離測量器顯示空氣中有高濃度的有毒化合物，並有強烈的熱源訊號。我們預計裡面應該會有大量的殭屍和其他危險的東西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"All I can tell you is that they were conducting cutting-edge research "
"related to-\" The intercom abruptly cuts off for several seconds before "
"coming back on, the voice sounding apologetic, \"Sorry, but as it turns out "
"I'm not at liberty to divulge that information."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I'll see if I can't get that data for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I've done my part.  What now?"
msgstr "好了，我已經盡了我的責任了。現在呢？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, alright."
msgstr "好的，好的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"And after ALL THAT, I find your manufacturing lab on the other end of this "
"thing straight out of a fever dream nightmare, and after ALL THAT, I find "
"your photonics, and then I have to get ALL THE WAY out of the ENTIRE ZOMBIE-"
"INFESTED TOWN so I could bring you your stupid fucking template.  Are you "
"happy now?"
msgstr ""
"然後之後！我發現你們要的實驗室就在另外一端，中間有著某個瘋狂夢魘中跑出來的怪物檔著。接著最後！我找到了那個光子電路，我還需要穿過一整個殭屍橫行的城鎮，才能把那該死的模板拿回來給你們。現在你們滿意了嗎？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"As we discussed during acceptance of the contract, we were aware of "
"hazardous ground conditions, but we were unable to deduce further "
"information other than what was available through long-range sensing.  If "
"you would like to provide a description of the hazards present, we are "
"willing to document them."
msgstr ""
"就像我們之前在簽訂契約時討論過的，我們知道現場非常危險，但除了通過遠程感測器得知的訊息外，我們無法推斷其他資訊。如果你能將那存在的危險描述給我們，我們很樂意紀錄下來。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"At the moment, their origin is unclear.  The temperature profile of the "
"building is highly unusual, despite the damage, and is much denser than "
"wandering hordes observed through remote scouting.  A large amount of heat "
"consistent with an extremely high density of organisms appears to be "
"emanating from the basement itself.  We are, unfortunately, in the dark "
"about the cause of this density.  We would advise you remain observant and "
"note down any abnormalities."
msgstr ""
"目前來說，這些東西的來源並不明確。儘管遭到了破壞，這棟建築的溫度分布非常不尋常，而且通過遠程觀察到的殭屍群密度要大得多。那些大量的熱源和高密度的生物體似乎是從地下室散發出來的。不幸的是，我們對這種高密度的訊號產生的原因一無所知。我們建議你保持警惕並記錄任何異常情況。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Back to the contract itself…"
msgstr "回到契約本身..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Correct.  The source of the chemicals is unknown, as is the exact "
"composition; only trace amounts are present in the air itself.  We can, "
"however, extrapolate that something within the ruins is creating highly "
"poisonous emissions.  We do not know how strong these emissions will become,"
" or what form they will take."
msgstr ""
"沒錯。一些來源不明的化學物質，確切成份也不清楚。空氣中只存在著微量痕跡。然而，我們可以推斷出廢墟中的某些東西正在不斷排出劇毒氣體。我們不確定這些排放源頭有多強，或者以什麼形式出現的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Data Retrieval"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Description, huh?  Where to begin?  Let's start with the giant mob of "
"zombies that was infesting the building.  Oh, and there were also horrors "
"full of toxic gas that exploded when I got near them or killed one, so I was"
" constantly choking on fumes the whole time."
msgstr ""
"描述？嗯？該從哪裡開始？讓我們從充滿整個大樓的龐大殭屍群開始。喔，還有那些有毒氣體怪物，當我靠近或者殺死它們時，它們就會爆炸，所以我一直被毒煙嗆著。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Did you have any other concerns?"
msgstr "你還有其他顧慮嗎？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Iron Safari"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Disable and retrieve the unusual robot by <color_yellow>successfully "
"stunning it with the provided hm12 dazzle rifle or a scrambler "
"grenade,</color> then <color_yellow>quickly running up and deactivating the "
"robot before it recovers from the stun</color>.  You can keep shooting it "
"while it's stunned to prolong the time until it is active again.  You can "
"intercept the robot indicated by Hub 01, or find an inactive robot somewhere"
" else.  <color_yellow>You'll need some experience in electronics or "
"mechanics to disable it</color>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any idea what I just went through?"
msgstr "你知道我到底經歷了什麼嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any more work for me right now?"
msgstr "現在還有什麼工作可以給我做的？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Prado knew the risks, and she chose to follow through with the test "
"anyway.  Her death is cause for sadness, and it will affect us, but you "
"didn't even know her.  At least now, something of her work will remain."
msgstr "Prado知道其中的風險，但她還是選擇堅持到底。她的死是令人悲傷，也會影響我們。但你甚至不認識她。至少現在，她的一部份工作還會繼續保留。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysm, we lost contact with one of our sister sites, LIXA.  Aerial surveillance indicates that the facility's inhabitants are deceased, and beyond the now-zombified security detail, the site should be sparsely populated.  We want you to enter the facility and make a copy of what they were researching on the provided thumb drive.  Additionally, we will be providing you with a keycard that should at the very least get you in the front door.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We're offering a standard 5 HGC for successful retrieval of the data.  If that isn't enough of an incentive, we do have a manifest from before we lost contact with the facility showing a handful of specialized powered suits in inventory.  You are free to take any that are left."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Thank you very much.\"  The intercom recites a series of "
"coordinates.  \"Exercise a great deal of caution.  We do not know what the "
"conditions on the ground are like.  Use your best judgment.  As before, we "
"are willing to offer you protective gear, if you would like it."
msgstr ""
"太棒了。非常感謝。\"對講機念出了一系列座標。\"請格外謹慎。我們不知道那邊到底有什麼。發揮你的判斷能力。就像之前和你說的，如果你想要，我們願意提供你一套防護裝備。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Extremely dangerous?  What kind of danger should I expect?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic.\"  The intercom's tray slides shut, and then opens shortly "
"afterwards with your payment.  \"You have our thanks and our payment."
msgstr "好極了。\"對講機的托盤滑動後關閉，然後帶著你的報酬打開了。\"這是報酬，還有我們的感謝。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to sender"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Find the corpse of a Hub 01's AI researcher and retrieve the hard case they "
"brought with them during the evacuation."
msgstr "找到 Hub 01  的AI研究人員屍體，並取回撤離過程中攜帶的保險箱。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Give me a moment to look at your file… here we are.  Valid assignments are "
"turning up empty at the moment.  I'm afraid we have no open contracts for "
"you."
msgstr "給我點時間查看你的檔案...找到了。待分配任務查詢結果是空的。恐怕現在沒有適合你的工作。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I can handle it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't believe I'm cleared to-\"  You hear brief chatter.  \"Apologies; I was mistaken.  The manufacturer was, technically speaking, kept secret from the public.  As a result, it operated using an office tower as a front, and was located underground.  An elevator in the back of the building led to the basement, but it was likely destroyed in the damage - as a result, you will need to find a way down yourself.  While there were stairs as well, it's highly likely that they have been destroyed.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We advise bringing a way to safely enter and exit the lower level; a grappling hook would work well for this purpose.  Given the damage, the elevator shaft itself probably remains intact, and would be your likeliest point of entry to the underground portion of the building."
msgstr ""
"我不覺得以我的權限可以－\"你聽到簡短的討論。\"抱歉，剛剛說錯了。\"那個製造廠，技術上來說，不存在於公眾視線。因此，它使用一座辦公大樓做為掩護，主體位於地底下。大樓後面的一部電梯通往地下室，但那很可能已經被破壞了－所以，你需要自己找到下去的方式。雖然那邊也有樓梯，但也是高機率已被破壞。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我們的建議是，先找到一條安全進出地下樓層的方式；一個抓鉤可以很好的達成這個目的。考慮到損壞情況，電梯井本身可能仍然完好，這應該是你進入大樓地下室的最好途徑。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"I found it.  I found your template.  [Hand over the silicon photonics "
"template.]"
msgstr "我找到啦。你們要的模板。[遞出矽光子電路模板。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I found the robot, but…  [Hand over the trifacet remains.]"
msgstr "我找到那個機器人了，只是...[遞出trifacet殘骸。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I think I'll pass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I would like that gear, yes.  Tell me about it."
msgstr "我想要裝備，是的。和我說說。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I'll be back soon."
msgstr "我很快就回來。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr "這活我接了。測試地點在哪裡？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll pass on getting killed today, thanks."
msgstr "我今天可不想被殺，謝謝。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll take it.  Where's the convoy?"
msgstr "這活我接了。車隊在哪裡？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from LIXA.  [Hand over the data.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from the convoy.  [Hand over the hard case.]"
msgstr "我從車隊那回來了。[遞出保險箱。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm interested in that map."
msgstr "我對那張地圖有興趣。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "If I lose the ID card or the memory stick, what should I do?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you'll give me a moment…\"  You hear the sounds of typing.  \"Its designation is hm12, you may have seen it in the news.  It is a weapon which is mostly harmless to living targets, but is specifically designed to incapacitate robots without harming their internals.  Once a subject is stunned, it can be manually deactivated; That is, you must approach it and turn it off before it reactivates.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A shot will only stun the robot if you manage to hit its main sensory array, which will require good aim.  In short, try to use the weapon to stun it, then run up to it and examine it to find the, er, off switch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Return Field Data"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Investigate a nearby field and return with Dr. Prado and the robot prototype"
" she was testing.  Failing that, retrieve the I/O recorder stored within the"
" robot.  If the robot remains operational, avoid direct confrontation and "
"use EMP grenades to disable it."
msgstr ""
"調查附近的空地，找到並帶回Prado博士和她正在測試的原型機器人。若未成功，帶回機器人體內的輸出入記錄器。如果機器人仍處於運行狀態，避免直接進行戰鬥，並使用EMP手榴彈來關閉它。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Iron Safari"
msgstr "狩獵鋼鐵"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Is \"unfortunate\" how you usually describe someone being eviscerated by a "
"robot?"
msgstr "你們都喜歡使用\"不幸\"來形容那些被機器人摘除內臟的人？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It was ambushed on the road.\"  The intercom recites a series of "
"coordinates.  \"Report back with the hard case.  If the researcher brought "
"it with him, it will be intact; have no doubt about that."
msgstr "他們在路上遭到了伏擊。\"對講機念出一系列座標。\"帶著保險箱回來報告，如果研究員隨身攜帶著，那麼它應該完好無損；這是毫無疑問的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's an acronym that stands for Laser Interferometer eXodimensional "
"resonance Assay."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's built with experimental combat programming and some heavy-duty armor.  "
"Despite the armor, it's pretty nimble, so unless you've got a vehicle don't "
"expect to outrun it.  We decided to hold off on adding long-range weapons "
"until we finished the initial field testing, so if you can keep your "
"distance, you should be safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It's fine.  At least now we know for the future."
msgstr "好吧。至少現在我們知道了未來你們會多注意。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's do this, then.  Transfer the location."
msgstr "我幹了，那麼。把位置給我。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's never do that again."
msgstr "別再讓這種事情發生了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Light retrieval"
msgstr "找回光"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Lovely.  Just a moment; we will transfer the hm12 and handling procedures, which includes information of its last recorded location.\"\n"
"\n"
"The intercom tray thumps several times as objects are placed into it.  After about a minute, it slides open, revealing a slender weapon that looks a bit like a radar gun, a heavy battery, a sheaf of papers in a binder, and a UPS.  \"The hm12 draws power from a connected UPS.  Please remember to bring the specimen back *intact* - battered salvage is of no use to us.  To safely perform the task of deactivation, please review the provided documentation, and pay special attention to the procedures detailed in subsections IV and VII."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Not yet.  I'll get back to it."
msgstr "還沒有。我會繼續做。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Officially speaking, they were a senior DARPA researcher.  Their corpse "
"should stick out; it's likely the only one not wearing camouflage.  That's "
"all you need to know."
msgstr "官方說法，他曾是DARPA的高級研究員。他的屍體應該很明顯；可能是那個唯一沒穿迷彩服的人。你只需要知道這些。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh, but that's not all!  They were coming from a pair of giant fucking "
"tentacles coming out of the ground like a monster movie that were constantly"
" roaring and shaking the whole building, and toxic exploding spiders kept "
"crawling off and shooting poison darts at me until I got away or stopped the"
" tentacles themselves, which wasn't easy because the entire building had "
"come down around them."
msgstr ""
"喔，但這還不是全部！它們來自一對巨大的該死觸手，像怪物電影那樣從地底下伸出來，不停著咆嘯著，搖晃著整棟建築，有毒的爆炸蜘蛛不斷的爬行著，向我發射毒箭，直到我逃開或者被觸手擋住，這相當不容易，因為整棟建築都被它們弄倒塌了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of our scientists recently left the building to perform a field test of "
"a prototype robot, but failed to return.  We have not been able to contact "
"them.  Your job would be to investigate the testing site, and return with "
"her and the prototype.  Failing that, return with the data recorder that was"
" attached to our prototype."
msgstr ""
"我們的一位科學家最近離開建築物進行一場實地測試，但未能返回。我們無法聯繫到他。你的任務是調查現場，並把他和原型機一起帶回來。如果不行的話，至少把原型機上的資料記錄帶回來。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of our scout drones spotted a partially-malfunctioning robot of unconventional make while tracking an anomalous radiation spike close by.  We project that much knowledge could be gained from a close examination of this subject, and you would be tasked to retrieve it for us intact.  We will equip you with a prototype rifle and instructions on how to use it and deactivate the robot, if you accept.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"The success of this contract requires that the subject be brought back in an inactive state, and *not* destroyed.  A ruined robot is of no scientific value.  We emphasize that you use the hm12 to complete this task, though it will likely be a diffcult shot to make.  A scrambler grenade might also suffice, but an EMP blast would likely destroy the target outright.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 2 HGC, and you will be able to keep the hm12 rifle and the equipment used to operate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our facility once sourced advanced photonic circuitry from a nearby robotics manufacturer.  Their building suffered major damage during the portal storms, and collapsed almost entirely.  However, preliminary scouting reveals that the basement prototyping lab likely remains intact.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We ask you to investigate the ruins, and if possible, retrieve a template for the fabrication of said photonic circuitry.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 8 HGC, the standard heightened-hazard rate.  We are also willing to provide you with a set of protective gear at a considerable discount upon acceptance of the contract."
msgstr ""
"我們機構曾經從附近的機器人製造廠訂購先進光子電路。他們的建築在空間風暴中遭到了嚴重破壞，幾乎完全倒塌。不過，初步偵查顯示它們的地下原型實驗室可能保留完好。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我們想請你去調查那個廢墟，如果可以的話，將他們製造用的光子電路模板帶回來。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"完成任務將獎勵8個Hub 01金幣，做為標準危險津貼支付。我們也會在你接受任務後以相當大的折扣賣你一套防護裝備。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Pardon me.\"  The voice briefly turns away from the microphone and asks "
"something.  \"Very well.  I am cleared to tell you that it appeared near the"
" beginning of the portal storms, and during this time, it was logged and "
"documented.  No attempt was ever made to retrieve it before the government "
"collapsed.  That is all I am able to share with you at this time."
msgstr ""
"請稍等。\"聲音短暫的從麥克風遠離，似乎在問些什麼。\"很好，我可以告訴你，它在空間風暴開始時出現在附近，在這段時間內被識別且記錄下來了。在政府垮台之前，沒人試過把它帶回來。這就是我能告訴你的所有內容。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Please slow down-"
msgstr "請慢一點－"

#. ~ Description of mission "Data Retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Reach the LIXA facility, and search the area for anything of interest.  The "
"intercom warned you about a number of undead aboveground, and the high "
"probability of more underground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Light retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Reach the collapsed tower basement, and search the ruins for a photonic "
"circuitry template.  The intercom warned you about heavy enemy presence, and"
" of the existence of a hazardous environment."
msgstr "前往倒塌的大樓地下室廢墟，搜尋光子電路板模組。對講機警告你那裡有大量的敵人，並且環境相當惡劣。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return Field Data"
msgstr "取回現場數據"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return to sender"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about these heat signatures."
msgstr "和我具體說說熱源訊號。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about this rifle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That makes-"
msgstr "這可真是－"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That seems trivial.  Is there a catch?"
msgstr "這似乎很簡單。有什麼難點嗎？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"The convoy was composed of vehicles and personnel from the US Army, and it "
"was heavily armed.  Our surveillance of the area has shown that the majority"
" of the slain military personnel have revivified.  Resistance will be heavy,"
" but if possible, you may be able to locate and retrieve the hard case, then"
" exfiltrate without direct combat as long as you can outpace the undead "
"there.  Otherwise, bring a rifle and plenty of ammo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"The handling procedures you gave me seemed to predate the Cataclysm.  How "
"long had that robot been here?"
msgstr "你們給我的操作手冊似乎是在災變之前寫的。這台機器人在這多久了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The more I hear about this, the worse it sounds."
msgstr "我聽得越多，聽起來就越糟糕。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The weapon worked!  [Hand over the inactive trifacet.]"
msgstr "那把武器有用！[遞出關閉的trifacet。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Then it took me half an hour to find the way down, because there were holes "
"in the floor everywhere, and when I finally did, I was in the insides of a "
"goddamn flesh pit with flooding up to my ankles, and to complement the "
"innards hanging from the ceiling that I couldn't see through the gas that "
"would throw me ten feet and make me start drowning, there were dozens of "
"people fused together in lumps everywhere, and did I mention the poison gas?"
"  Because they were full of it too, and so everything reeked and it felt "
"like being in a giant fucking intestine full of people."
msgstr ""
"然後我花了半小時才找到下去的路，因為地板上到處都是洞，而且當我終於下去時，我在一個該死的肉坑裡，血水淹過了我的腳踝，還有那些因為毒氣讓我無法看清楚從天花板吊掛下來的各種內臟，能把我擊飛到10步遠，差點淹死，到處都是幾十具屍體聚成的屍堆，還有我剛剛有提到毒氣嗎？因為它們也是到處都是，所有東西都散發著惡臭，感覺就像在一個充滿人的巨大腸道中。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"There is.  If the robot is operational, it's very likely to be hostile and "
"extremely dangerous.  I don't recommend fighting it directly.  Dr. Prado "
"left the building with a handful of EMP grenades.  If you can locate those "
"grenades, use them to disable the prototype instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"To be specific, there have been anomalous readings that we are unable to "
"explain.  Seismic disturbances have been recorded emanating from the ruins, "
"with a magnitude ranging from two to four, and periodic vocalizations have "
"been documented to exceed 150 decibels.  We are uncertain why or how these "
"phenomena are created."
msgstr ""
"更具體的說，有些異常我們無法解釋。我們紀錄到廢墟中發出了地震干擾，震級2級到4級之間不等，周期性發出超過150分貝的聲音。我們不能確定這些現象的產生原因或者方式。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Toxic compounds?"
msgstr "有毒化合物？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Transferring the items now.\"  The intercom tray slides open, revealing an "
"ID card for the facility and what looks like a USB thumb drive.  \"Again: "
"please take care not to lose either of these since we can't exactly make "
"more of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more
#. variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "了解。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Very close by.\"  The voice lists off some relative coordinates.  \"Good "
"luck."
msgstr "就在附近。\"聲音列出了些相對坐標。\"祝你好運。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"We are as of yet uncertain of its origin and purpose.  Its body most closely"
" resembles a pyramid on what we believe are three sets of legs for mobility."
"  It is lightly armed, and has attacked our cam-spy drones using high-"
"voltage electric discharge.  We theorize that this is most likely for "
"deterrence, and not to cause direct harm.  Nonetheless, we need to emphasize"
" that its full capabilities are unknown, and we do not know how it will "
"react when confronted with a living threat."
msgstr ""
"到目前為止，我們還不確定它的來源和目的。它的身體看起來接近金字塔形，我們認為它底下應該有三對可移動的腿。它具有輕型武裝，並使用高壓放電攻擊了我們的偵查無人機。我們推測這可能只是為了威懾，而非直接造成傷害。儘管如此，我們需要強調，它所擁有的能力是未知的，我們不知道它面對活體威脅時會做出什麼反應。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, the ID card wouldn't strictly speaking be necessary if you were to "
"find some way of breaching the facility's security doors.\" The voice pauses"
" for a moment, \"But that said we only have the one ID card, so unless "
"you're confident you can get in without it, please don't lose it.  As for "
"the memory stick I would highly recommend you not lose that as portable "
"drives with the required hardware security modules to interface with secure "
"terminals are in short supply these days.  However there may very well be "
"some on-site for you to scavenge if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What can you tell me about what they were doing there?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What do you mean by-"
msgstr "你剛剛說－"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What does LIXA even mean?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What else do you have available?"
msgstr "還有什麼別的工作嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What is this robot, and what does it look like?"
msgstr "那個機器人是啥？看起來像什麼？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What should I expect to go up against?"
msgstr "我會面對些什麼敵人？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr "你想談些什麼？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"When the portal storms started, the government issued an evacuation order for critical personnel and sent convoys to retrieve them, with our head of AI research among the recalled.  We recently discovered that he died when the convoy transferring him was ambushed in the initial chaos, but his corpse and belongings might remain intact enough to benefit from his research.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We want you to travel to the convoy and locate the body, if possible.  His evacuation protocol included retrieving and storing as much of the data from his facility as possible, to be stored in a code-locked hard case.  If this hard case is present, retrieve it, and bring it back here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We offer the standard hazard pay of 4 HGC for this contract."
msgstr ""
"當空間風暴來臨時，政府向關鍵人員發出撤離命令，並派出了車隊去迎接他們，我們的AI研究員也名列其中。我們最近發現他似乎在迎接他的車隊時在混亂中遭到伏擊死了，但他的屍體和隨身物品可能還是完好，而我們可以從他的研究中獲得些有用資訊。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"如果可能的話，我們希望你前往車隊處去尋找他的遺體。他的撤離命令中包含從他所在設施盡可能儲存有用資料，並將它們存放在一個密碼保護的保險箱中。如果保險箱還在的話，找到它並帶回來這裡。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"為此任務我們將支付4個 Hub 01 金幣做為標準危險津貼。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Where is this manufacturer?"
msgstr "這個製造廠在哪裡？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Who was this person, and what do they look like?"
msgstr "這個人是誰？他長什麼樣子？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Will this weapon work on other robots, as well?"
msgstr "這把槍對其它機器人也有用嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah.  You're welcome."
msgstr "是的，是的。不客氣。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Yes, almost certainly.  UGVs, autonomous CROWS units, manhacks, and other "
"drones should all be vulnerable to the weapon, although we advise great "
"caution; as you might have found, it can be difficult to precisely hit the "
"target."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You certainly gave me a run for my money, I'll say that much."
msgstr "我只想說，你們這次可是讓我為了這些錢而竭盡全力了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You mention hazard pay.  What dangers are there?"
msgstr "你提到了危險津貼。那兒有什麼危險？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You're back.  Do you have anything to report?"
msgstr "你回來了。有什麼要報告的嗎？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You've got a deal.  I'll track down your robot."
msgstr "就這麼定了。我會找到你們要的機器人。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your hesitation is understandable.  Unfortunately, we have already taken all"
" possible measures to obtain data and information remotely, but we are "
"unable to develop our understanding further without a physical presence."
msgstr "你的猶豫是可以理解的。不幸的是，我們已經盡可能的遠程獲得資料和資訊，但如果不實地探訪，我們無法進一步了解。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your scientist was dead, but I disabled the prototype.  Is this what you "
"were looking for?  [Hand over the prototype I/O recorder.]"
msgstr "你們的科學家死了，不過我成功關閉了機器人。這就是你們要的嗎？[遞出原型輸出入記錄器。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Data Retrieval]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Iron Safari]"
msgstr "[契約：狩獵鋼鐵]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Light retrieval]"
msgstr "[契約：找回光]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Return to sender]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[Detail the conditions at the collapsed tower and its basement.  This will "
"advance time by ten minutes.]"
msgstr "[詳細說明倒塌大樓及其地下室的情況。一直講了快10分鐘。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[Detail the conditions at the research facility.  This will advance time by "
"ten minutes.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Let them know how bad that mission REALLY was.]"
msgstr "[讓他們知道這個任務到底有多麼糟糕。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[PER 8] The original markings on that case had been scratched out.  Who did "
"it really belong to?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Stop talking.]"
msgstr "[停下談話。]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "…Just forget it.  Let's never speak of this again."
msgstr "...忘了它吧。我再也不會提這個了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"…Uh.  We are- thank you for finding the photonics.  We will, ah, make sure "
"that the threat conditions of your future contracts are adequately assessed."
"  Um.  Thank you."
msgstr "...呃。我們－非常感謝你找到的光子電路。我們會，嗯，確保今後契約中的威脅條件被充分評估。嗯，非常感謝你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"Given the context of your assignment, we are willing to sell you a set of "
"our protective gear - a gas mask and an environmental suit - at a "
"considerable discount.  We will part with it for two exchange coins.\"  The "
"intercom waits expectantly.  \"Actually, hold on, we might not have one in "
"your size…"
msgstr ""
"鑒於你之前的任務內容，我們打算以一個相當優惠的價格賣給你一套我們的防護裝備－防毒面具和環境防護衣。只要2個金幣。\"對講機停了一下。\"說回來，等等，我們可能沒有你這個尺寸的..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I have to give it a thought."
msgstr "我不得不考慮一下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I'll have to give it some thought."
msgstr "我得再想想。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"To assist your operations, we are willing to sell you a map of the local "
"area, as surveyed by our cam-spy drones.  Its standing price is 1 HGC."
msgstr "為了協助你的任務，我們願意向你出售一份由偵查無人機繪製的本區域地圖。它的標準價格為 1個 Hub 01 金幣。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"What the gas mask does should be obvious; we'll provide you with a cartridge, of course.  The environment suit is full-body, and protects you from water, harmful radiation, and environmental hazards.  It's also rated to protect from electric shocks of up to twelve thousand volts.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Bear in mind that the suit isn't armor.  It will keep you safe from the environment, but it's just Nomex and it won't protect you from anything stronger than a punch.  The modular defense system is designed to fit over it, so I'd urge you to bring them both if fighting is unavoidable."
msgstr ""
"防毒面具的作用是顯而易見的；當然，我們會提供濾芯。這個防護衣是設計成全身防護，防水、防有害輻射和各種環境災害。而且聽過測試可以防止高達1.2萬瓦的電擊傷害。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"請記住，這套防護服並不是盔甲。它可以防護各種環境危害，但它只是諾梅克斯做的，沒辦法保護你免受任何比拳頭還強的傷害。模組化防禦系統倒是可以穿戴在它外面，如果戰鬥無法避免，我建議你把它們都穿上。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "What will it do for me?"
msgstr "這對我有什麼用？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[1 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[1 Hub 01 金幣] 成交！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[2 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[2 Hub 01 金幣] 成交！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"As I said, that's the thing I need.  You don't need to know what's that "
"exactly.  Just grab all things you find in the safe, and call it a day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"At last!  Give me a second to check if it isn't damaged.  Here, take this "
"for your troubles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Can we just talk it over?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Did you get the card already?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Do I have a <swear> exclamation sign over my <swear> head, like I'm a "
"<swear> quest-giver from some <swear> video game?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Fine, I'll get it sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Gee, what's the matter with you?  Okay, okay, I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Great!  Don't try to use the card now, just bring it straight to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hello there.  Haven't seen you around before.  You must be from the other "
"wing.  Managed to survive, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's
#. office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Here's the job…"
msgstr "這裡有個工作..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!  You'll regret that!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, no need to be hostile.  Here you go, I don't need it anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hey, where did you get it?  Nevermind, just give it to me.  Just <swear> "
"now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
