msgstr "大天使聖米迦勒在戰鬥中守護我..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Survivors were talkin' 'bout seeing 'em falling out of the sky but I don't "
"know where.  If I were a pilot I'd avoid crash landing in a city or forest "
"though.  Black boxes are housed in the tail to survive the crash so check "
"there when you do find one.  Now get to it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return"
" to your side."
msgstr "拿著我的狗哨。假如狗狗跑走了, 吹響這個狗哨他就會回來你身邊了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr "拿著這個USB隨身碟。使用控制台, 然後下載軟體。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
