"To be honest with you, it's been pretty difficult.  I sneak out at night or "
"whenever there's an opening to grab whatever I need and come back before "
"something notices me.  I've been held up for quite a while whenever a horde "
"decides to pass by.  Good thing we had some spare bookcases lying around, or"
" I'd be a goner by now."
msgstr ""

