"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr "喔, 我並沒有惡意。在荒野這麼長的時間, 我發現我自己會先在看到之前先聞到。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
