#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Hacker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen made you an "
"expert at writing and cracking code.  The power's gone out, and suddenly "
"your elite skills seem significantly less useful.  At least there's no one "
"stopping you from your dream of breaking into a military mainframe now."
msgstr ""
"咖啡因錠和通霄坐在電腦螢幕前使你成為寫程式和駭入的專家。現在電源中斷了，突然間你的精英技能顯得不那麼有用了。至少現在沒有人會阻止你侵入軍事主機的夢想。"

