"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Big-Bore Hunter" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always harbored a passion for hunting and a particular fondness for big-"
"bore rifle calibers and affordable conversion kits.  Whether it was their "
"cost-effective nature or the simple, testosterone-amplifying notion that you"
" could retool your rifle to belt out .50-caliber bullets, you preferred them"
" for your hunting trips.  Now, with your converted rifle in hand, you fancy "
"that there isn't any game too large for you to take down."
msgstr ""
"你一直對打獵充滿熱情，對大口徑步槍和價格實惠的改裝套件尤其喜愛。也許是因為這些改裝套件性價比高，或者只是因為可以將步槍改裝成射出.50口徑子彈的概念能增加你的血液中的睾丸激素，所以你更喜歡它們用於打獵。現在，手握改裝過的步槍，你自信地認為沒有任何獵物是你拿不下的。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Big-Bore Hunter" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always harbored a passion for hunting and a particular fondness for big-"
"bore rifle calibers and affordable conversion kits.  Whether it was their "
"cost-effective nature or the simple, testosterone-amplifying notion that you"
" could retool your rifle to belt out .50-caliber bullets, you preferred them"
" for your hunting trips.  Now, with your converted rifle in hand, you fancy "
"that there isn't any game too large for you to take down."
msgstr ""
"你一直對打獵充滿熱情，對大口徑步槍和價格實惠的改裝套件尤其喜愛。也許是因為這些改裝套件性價比高，或者只是因為可以將步槍改裝成射出.50口徑子彈的概念能增加你的血液中的睾丸激素，所以你更喜歡它們用於打獵。現在，手握改裝過的步槍，你自信地認為沒有任何獵物是你拿不下的。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from"
" which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an "
"act of rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that "
"flame of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"你和一群志同道合的人在樹林中建立了一個藏身處，用來發起掠奪搶劫的行動，使用一輛臨時修改的皮卡車。上次的行動失敗了，現在你的同伴都已經死去。現在，你每一次呼吸都是對這個注定會毀滅的世界殘酷的反抗。不要讓內心的希望之火熄滅。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from"
" which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an "
"act of rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that "
"flame of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
