"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr "你剛剛從一次舒適的熱水淋浴中走出來，卻發現世界已經終結了。你手上拿著一些肥皂，以及最實用的東西——一條毛巾。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You know kung fu.  Pretty much everyone else is dead, so maybe that makes "
"you The One."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
