#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr "你熱愛開車，並決定藉此賺點錢。在前往接客人的途中，周圍爆發了一場騷亂。你為了安全起見，繞了一個很長的彎路，最終發現自己身處一個陌生的地方。"

