msgstr "在整個世界都在你周圍崩潰前，你為老年人提供著家庭護理。你只能祈禱你不會看到你的前客戶在行屍走肉的行列中..."

#. ~ Description of profession "Test Subject" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand "
"the immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to "
"spite them for what they did to you."
msgstr "你是一個人形的實驗材料，讓實驗室的技術人員了解突變的巨大力量。你決心要生存下去，要是能去怨恨他們對你所做的一切就好了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Test Subject" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand "
"the immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to "
"spite them for what they did to you."
msgstr "你是一個人形的實驗材料，讓實驗室的技術人員了解突變的巨大力量。你決心要生存下去，要是能去怨恨他們對你所做的一切就好了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier"
" adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up "
"for a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was "
"somehow flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the "
"only one who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay "
"here.  At least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""
"你是一名海軍特種作戰潛水組的成員，是一名擅長水下滲透和海上作戰的熟練士兵。你正在穿戴裝備準備進行一次潛水訓練，這時你所駐紮的航空母艦不知何故從黃海被甩到了某個未知的地方。你似乎是唯一一個保持理智倖存下來的人，但在待在這裡很危險。至少你已經裝備齊全準備好棄船了。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier"
