msgstr "左輪手槍製造"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid ""
"Similar to bowyery, the art of making guns that are powered by elastic "
"mechanisms."
msgstr "類似於弓箭製造，用彈性機關來提供射擊動力的藝術。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid "Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows"
msgstr "彈簧動力槍械和十字弓製造"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Firearm Cleaning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/gunsmithing.json
msgid ""
"You know how to quickly disassemble guns, clean them, and reassemble them in"
