#. ~ Description of proficiency "High Pressure Systems"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"You know how to safely and efficiently build, repair, maintain and use "
"various appliances that make use of high pressure."
msgstr "你知道如何安全的建造、維修、保養和使用各種應用高壓系統的設備。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Chemical Engineering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"You know how to safely and efficiently build, repair, maintain and use "
"various complex machinery that makes use of chemical processes."
msgstr "你知道如何安全有效的建造、維修、保養和使用各種化學處理反應的複雜機械。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Airframe and Powerplant Mechanic"
#: data/json/proficiencies/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"You've been trained and certified to repair aircraft.  You're not really "
"sure how that could help you survive now."
msgstr "你曾經受訓並獲得飛機維修的證照。但你不確定這東西現在如何幫助你生存。"

