#. ~ Description of scenario "Mass Quarantine" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their"
" manpower to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone"
" into did nothing to slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You"
" managed to slip away from the worst violence but you are now surrounded and"
" need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"當聯邦緊急事務管理局的營地容納不下更多人時，當局利用他們剩餘的人力以槍口脅迫人群進入體育場，但這沒有減緩如野火般蔓延的混亂。你設法躲過了砲火，但現在你被包圍住了而且需要迅速逃出去！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mass Quarantine" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their"
" manpower to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone"
" into did nothing to slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You"
" managed to slip away from the worst violence but you are now surrounded and"
" need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"當聯邦緊急事務管理局的營地容納不下更多人時，當局利用他們剩餘的人力以槍口脅迫人群進入體育場，但這沒有減緩如野火般蔓延的混亂。你設法躲過了砲火，但現在你被包圍住了而且需要迅速逃出去！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Prison" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now"
" the inmates and guards alike have turned into mindless horrors and joined "
"forces… you might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr "大災變發生時，你被判刑入監或在監獄裡工作。現在囚犯和獄警們變成了沒思想的可怕怪物……你或許要加速你的越獄行動了。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Prison" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now"
" the inmates and guards alike have turned into mindless horrors and joined "
"forces… you might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr "大災變發生時，你被判刑入監或在監獄裡工作。現在囚犯和獄警們變成了沒思想的可怕怪物……你或許要加速你的越獄行動了。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Shutdown" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now"
" you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to "
"be your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's "
"been a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you "
"find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"當大災變發生時，你正在一座核電廠工作。現在你被困在其中，被曾是你同事的搖搖欲墜的屍體包圍。反應爐已經停止運作，但你不知道是否發生了輻射洩漏，你需要在用身體測出輻射值之前盡快離開這裡。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Shutdown" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now"
" you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to "
"be your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's "
"been a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you "
"find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"當大災變發生時，你正在一座核電廠工作。現在你被困在其中，被曾是你同事的搖搖欲墜的屍體包圍。反應爐已經停止運作，但你不知道是否發生了輻射洩漏，你需要在用身體測出輻射值之前盡快離開這裡。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Sheltered" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse broke out, you were evacuated to a small underground "
"bunker.  Here you have lived, never leaving, lest the dangers of the unknown"
" find you.  Supplies are running low, and for the first time since the "
"Cataclysm, you will be forced to face the outside world."
msgstr ""
"在災變爆發時，你疏散到了一座小型地堡。你在裡面生活，足不出戶，以免來自外界的「未知」危險。隨著物資減少，你不得不… 打從災變以來第一次… "
"被迫面對外面的世界。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Sheltered" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse broke out, you were evacuated to a small underground "
"bunker.  Here you have lived, never leaving, lest the dangers of the unknown"
" find you.  Supplies are running low, and for the first time since the "
"Cataclysm, you will be forced to face the outside world."
msgstr ""
