"被迫面對外面的世界。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lost Underground" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days "
"later you are lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr "當騷亂侵襲到你的家時，你逃到地下並躲藏起來。現在過了幾天，你迷失了方向，然後聽到了黑暗中回蕩著動靜的聲音。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lost Underground" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days "
"later you are lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr "當騷亂侵襲到你的家時，你逃到地下並躲藏起來。現在過了幾天，你迷失了方向，然後聽到了黑暗中回蕩著動靜的聲音。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Missed" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and are stuck in a city full of the risen dead."
msgstr "不論是固執、無知、或只是運氣不好的原因，你就是錯過了疏散行動，並困在一個滿是活死人的城市。"

