#. ~ Description of scenario "Helicopter Crash" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While being transported to a different military base, the pilot lost control"
" of the helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  You seem to be the"
" only survivor."
msgstr "在被運送到另一個軍事基地途中，飛行員失去了對直升機的控制，並在茫茫荒野中墜毀了。看來只有你活了下來。"

