#. ~ Description of gun "underbarrel launcher (modified)"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "underbarrel launcher (modified)"
#. ~ Description of "underbarrel launcher (modified)"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/gunmods/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A stubby single shot launcher for launching grenades or flares.  This "
"launcher can be attached to a rifle or other suitable platform, and includes"
" its own set of sights.  In more recent years, variants were sold "
"commercially to ostensibly launch flares.  With the right cartridges, this "
"would be devastating against hard or soft targets.  A crude homemade bracket"
" has been attached, allowing a wider variety of hosts."
msgstr ""

