#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
msgid "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
msgstr "僅有克蘇魯生物"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Removes all the zombies (including fungus zombies), cyborgs and robots from "
"the game and replaces them with a variety of Lovecraftian monsters - "
"intended to be part of a total conversion mod but can be used as a "
"standalone if wanted."
msgstr ""
"將所有的殭屍（包括真菌殭屍）、機械人和機器人從遊戲中移除，並將它們替換為各種洛夫克拉夫特式的怪物——這是一個完全轉換的模組的一部分，但如果希望，也可以作為獨立模組使用。"

#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS"
