#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_deathconfirmed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"You feel the icy grip of death begin to take you, and the world whirls and "
"rushes past.  Reality bends and at the peak of your last mortal moment, "
"something snags you and hauls you through space and time.  Your mind has "
"been preserved, at cost, and your body is not far behind."
msgstr ""
"你感受到死亡的冰冷之握開始吞噬你，整個世界迴旋、掠過。現實彎曲，在你最後的臨死時刻，某種力量抓住了你，拉你穿越時空。你的思想已被救下了，但代價不小，你的身體也一樣。"

