msgstr "過長的傳送正在摧毀你。你正在分崩離析。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The bile suddenly rises in your throat and your fingers feel like they're "
"peeling themselves open.  Your warp sickness is getting worse.  You should "
"get home soon."
msgstr "胃酸突然湧上喉頭，你的手指感覺就像他們在把自己撕開。你的傳送失調正在加劇。你應該盡快回家。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The ravages of the world intensify.  Everything hurts and existence is a "
"surreal wash of pain.  Your warp sickness is unbearable.  You need to get "
"home as soon as possible."
msgstr "世界的摧殘逐漸加劇。一切都痛苦不堪，存在是一場超現實的痛苦洗禮。你的傳送失調讓你難以忍受。你需要盡快回家。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The rending of the warp has finally abated.  You feel like you exist again."
msgstr "撕裂的傳送力量終於消散了。你感覺自己再次存在。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Necrosis"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The very fabric of your being is unraveling!  You're in dire straits.  You "
"need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"
msgstr "你的存在本質正在解體！你處於生死關頭中。你現在必須立刻返回你的空島！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The whole world shimmers in front of your eyes.  Everything feels slow and "
"sticky.  Warp sickness is setting in.  You should focus on getting home."
msgstr "整個世界在你眼前閃爍。一切感覺都變得緩慢而黏膩。傳送失調開始發作了。你應該想想回家的事了。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"There are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is "
"crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All "
"you know is pain.  You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.  Your only "
"hope is escape to your sanctuary, but oblivion is only moments away."
msgstr ""
"你已經無法形容自己陷入了多大的麻煩。你的身體正在破碎成泥，你的血液扭曲成藤蔓纏繞。你只感受到痛苦。你不僅僅是在死亡，而是在可怕地死去。唯一的希望是逃離到你的空島，但湮滅只消片刻。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Debilitation"
msgstr "傳送虛弱"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Disintegration!"
msgstr "傳送瓦解！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Nausea"
msgstr "傳送噁心"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Necrosis"
msgstr "傳送壞死"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Sickness"
msgstr "傳送失調"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Stability"
msgstr "傳送穩定性"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpcloak"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warpcloaked"
msgstr "傳送匿蹤"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthside"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are away from your sanctuary island.  Over time, you will begin to "
"succumb to the intangible miasma of the world below, and your stats will "
"suffer.  You have several hours after warp before this becomes a problem, "
"after which it will rapidly get worse until you warp home or die."
msgstr ""
"你離開了你的庇護島嶼。隨著時間的推移，你將開始受到下界無形的瘴氣影響，你的屬性會受到影響。在傳送之後的數小時內，這不會成為問題，之後情況將迅速惡化，直到你傳送回家或死亡。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are invisible for a very brief time.  Now's your chance to get to cover."
"  You're also incorporeal enough to not take fall damage, but hopefully that"
" won't be relevant."
msgstr "你在極短的時間內隱形。現在是你找掩蔽的機會。你的身體也變得無形能避免摔傷，希望你用不到這項能力。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You fully materialize.  You're not invisible anymore!"
msgstr "你完全實體化了。你不再隱形了！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You taste blood and your eyes sink back into their sockets.  You've stayed "
"out too long.  Your warp sickness is about to consume you entirely and "
"you're falling apart at the seams.  Get home NOW!"
msgstr "你嘗到了血腥味，眼睛陷入了眼窩。你在外面逗留的時間太長了。你的傳送失調即將完全吞噬你，你正從接縫處散開。現在就回家！快！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You're being unmade!"
msgstr "你正在解體！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're fresh from your stay at your sanctuary island.  The intangible miasma"
" of terra firma currently has no effect on you, and you feel fine.  This "
"should last for several hours.  Stay too long, however, and you'll gradually"
" begin to suffer ever-worsening debilitating effects."
msgstr ""
"你剛從空島到來，現在陸地的無形瘴氣還沒有任何影響，你感覺很好。這種狀態應該會持續幾個小時。然而，如果停留的時間太長，你將逐漸開始遭受越來越嚴重的虛弱效果。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Disintegration!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every "
"pore, you'd find a better way to emphasize just how badly you're dying.  "
"Your only hope is to return home immediately."
msgstr "你快要死了。要不是你正忙著從每個毛孔滲出血來，你會找到更好的方式來強調你離死亡有多麼接近。你唯一的希望就是立刻返回家中。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Nausea"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've overstayed your time earthside.  It's getting hard to concentrate, "
"there's a painful ringing in your ears, and your muscles sting and jolt.  "
"Every action feels delayed.  You need to warp home to refresh yourself, or "
"this is going to get worse.  Probably within just a few hours."
msgstr ""
"你在地面的待太久了。集中注意力變得困難，耳裡響著痛苦的鈴聲，肌肉感到刺痛和抽動。每一個動作都感覺緩慢。你需要立刻回到家中讓自己恢復，否則情況可能只需要幾個小時就會變得更糟。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Debilitation"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your "
"senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very "
"air is like breathing fiberglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp "
"home as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"你在地面停留的時間太長了！你的身體幾乎沒有反應，感官也變得麻木。世界感覺像是被鋸齒割裂，空氣就像是呼吸玻璃纖維一樣。如果你想生存下去，你需要儘快回到家中。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Sickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside too long.  Your body aches and your senses are "
"dulling.  Every step feels like you're walking through thick mud and "
"breathing hot tar.  You should warp home as soon as you can, or this is only"
" going to get worse."
msgstr ""
"你在地面停留的時間太長了。你的身體疼痛，感官也變得遲鈍。每一步感覺就像在走在厚重的泥巴上，吸入的空氣像熱焦油一樣。你應該儘快回家，否則情況只會變得更糟。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity ore"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A roiling, rattling mass of ever-churning metal.  Flares of purple energy arc around the formless pile like electricity, and in their wake, thin metal rods and struts jut out, before disappearing into the half-molten heap which never seems to grow or diminish.  Its strange nature allows you to shift it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this ore allows you to produce raw and basic metal items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "warpglass wall"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A shimmering translucent barrier that almost yields to the touch, but "
"adamantly refuses entry."
msgstr "閃爍著的半透明屏障，幾乎可以觸碰到，但堅決拒絕事物進入。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped rock"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A sparkly-black stone that's glassy smooth to the touch.  Seems "
"indestructible by normal means."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "Return Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A strange statue that will take you back home."
msgstr "能帶你回家的奇怪雕像。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Island's Heart"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A swirling, surreal statue of organic shapes carved from dark stone.  In your head, a voice speaks faintly.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Island's Heart"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity tree"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Purple-blue shimmers sparkle around the leaves of this small sapling.  New growth seems to spring up in seconds, as if in a timelapse, and yet there never seem to be too many branches.  It's always in equilibrium.  Its strange nature allows you to push it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this tree allows you to produce raw wooden items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Return Obelisk"
msgstr "回歸方尖碑"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"This is the edge of the island.  A metaphysical border stops you from going "
"over the edge yourself, but anything you drop here will be gone forever."
msgstr "這是島嶼的邊緣。一個超自然的邊界阻止你自己走過邊緣，但你丟在這裡的東西將永遠消失。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Warp Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"This strange, towering monolith is the only lifeline you have to the outside world.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Warp Obelisk"
msgstr "傳送方尖碑"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity stone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Wisps of iridescent energy spark around this immense stone like miniature fireworks, leaving behind a satisfying showers of pebbles.  Clay and soil shift around its base, erupting in slow motion yet never overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this stone allows you to produce rocks and natural earthen items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "warped rock"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "glzt!"
msgstr ""

