msgid "the natives have a saying: \"e pluribus unum.\"  out of many, one."
msgstr "當地人有句話說：＂e pluribus unum。＂合眾為一。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1401
msgid ""
"The blazing pink redness of the berry.  The juices spreading across our "
