"If true, enables automatic use of wielded mops to clean surrounding terrain."
msgstr "設定為「是」，自動使用手持的拖把把周圍的地形拖乾淨。"

#: src/options.cpp:1586
msgid "Auto foraging"
msgstr "自動採集"

#: src/options.cpp:1587
